(1616749, 218248, 34247, '<td valign="top">I find this a compelling composition, but there''s just a bit too much "darkness" to it and not enough mood. I know perhaps the attempt is to hint at the subject being moonlit, but for me, the woman just blends in a bit too much into the background, and perhaps the image could benefit from a change in contrast value. 7 for the idea.</td>', 'I find this a compelling composition, but there''s just a bit too much "darkness" to it and not enough mood. I know perhaps the attempt is to hint at the subject being moonlit, but for me, the woman just blends in a bit too much into the background, and perhaps the image could benefit from a change in contrast value. 7 for the idea.', '2005-08-17 03:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
