(1617048, 218188, 39880, '<td valign="top">sharper focus would help.</td>', 'sharper focus would help.', '2005-08-17 07:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617049, 218833, 39880, '<td valign="top">just what I thought of when thinking of live music.  Head bangin'' guitars.</td>', 'just what I thought of when thinking of live music.  Head bangin'' guitars.', '2005-08-17 07:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617056, 217556, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame about the midday sun, not the best time to grab photos. I think this photo would have worked better with a sense of context... are people ignoring him, or do they like the music?</td>', 'Shame about the midday sun, not the best time to grab photos. I think this photo would have worked better with a sense of context... are people ignoring him, or do they like the music?', '2005-08-17 07:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617057, 218063, 8522, '<td valign="top">Face seems too soft, and I''m really missing her left hand and right elbow. I think shots where the performer has their arms outstretched are always better when you capture the entire arm. I don''t think her expression is exceptional, I''m sure she will have had better expressions throughout her set.</td>', 'Face seems too soft, and I''m really missing her left hand and right elbow. I think shots where the performer has their arms outstretched are always better when you capture the entire arm. I don''t think her expression is exceptional, I''m sure she will have had better expressions throughout her set.', '2005-08-17 07:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617058, 218891, 8522, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of the face peering in through the door makes this photo for me, great use of fisheye. Great expressions on your subjects. Composition works well. Slight overexposure works well in reducing extraneous detail.</td>', 'The inclusion of the face peering in through the door makes this photo for me, great use of fisheye. Great expressions on your subjects. Composition works well. Slight overexposure works well in reducing extraneous detail.', '2005-08-17 07:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617060, 217426, 23394, '<td valign="top">if you hadn''t digitized this to death, i would have scored it much, much higher.</td>', 'if you hadn''t digitized this to death, i would have scored it much, much higher.', '2005-08-17 07:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617061, 218663, 8522, '<td valign="top">I don''t get much of a sense of the music from looking at the photo... perhaps a slightly longer shutter speed with more motion blur from the hands could have helped. The head of the performer on the right spoils the shot. Noise is a bit excessive, I''d have used a lower ISO with a longer shutter speed. Performer''s expression doesn''t seem particularly special.</td>', 'I don''t get much of a sense of the music from looking at the photo... perhaps a slightly longer shutter speed with more motion blur from the hands could have helped. The head of the performer on the right spoils the shot. Noise is a bit excessive, I''d have used a lower ISO with a longer shutter speed. Performer''s expression doesn''t seem particularly special.', '2005-08-17 07:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617066, 218457, 23394, '<td valign="top">i see the outlines, but ain''t getting much else...too much post-processing for me.</td>', 'i see the outlines, but ain''t getting much else...too much post-processing for me.', '2005-08-17 07:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617068, 218478, 8522, '<td valign="top">Typical concert snapshot, although you did try and get a moment where the audience had their hands in the air. It''s difficult to make out here though, the silhouettes aren''t clear enough. Photo is slightly tilted and could have done with straightening. Composition is my main gripe here... the performer is looking to the right of the frame... I would therefore have placed them on the left of the shot otherwise the left 2/3rds of the shot feels pointless.</td>', 'Typical concert snapshot, although you did try and get a moment where the audience had their hands in the air. It''s difficult to make out here though, the silhouettes aren''t clear enough. Photo is slightly tilted and could have done with straightening. Composition is my main gripe here... the performer is looking to the right of the frame... I would therefore have placed them on the left of the shot otherwise the left 2/3rds of the shot feels pointless.', '2005-08-17 07:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617070, 217939, 23394, '<td valign="top">image looks like it has potential, but way too much post-processing for my taste.</td>', 'image looks like it has potential, but way too much post-processing for my taste.', '2005-08-17 07:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617071, 217274, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame about the 3 heads in the foreground. Harsh sun really spoils the shot, especially as the audience are looking into it. Why centre your performer? This seems unimaginative. The head is too near the top edge of the shot. Very impressive acrobatics though, I can''t imagine being able to do that... does he keep the rhythm of his violin playing steady?</td>', 'Shame about the 3 heads in the foreground. Harsh sun really spoils the shot, especially as the audience are looking into it. Why centre your performer? This seems unimaginative. The head is too near the top edge of the shot. Very impressive acrobatics though, I can''t imagine being able to do that... does he keep the rhythm of his violin playing steady?', '2005-08-17 07:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617072, 217522, 8522, '<td valign="top">How on earth does this meet the challenge?</td>', 'How on earth does this meet the challenge?', '2005-08-17 07:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617074, 218883, 29474, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Just a pity that the water behind their heads is so washed out. It might also be better with the shorline croppppped away.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Just a pity that the water behind their heads is so washed out. It might also be better with the shorline croppppped away.', '2005-08-17 07:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617079, 217390, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not at all keen on the skin tones which are far too red, I''d have attempted some colour balancing in PS. If you''re going to have hands in a shot of a musician, don''t chop the fingers off. Trumpeter''s expression doesn''t seem particularly special here... wait for a moment of chemistry when he emotes during a special passage during the music. It''s unimaginative and easy to crop so close... I want to see a sense of context... where is he playing, where is he?</td>', 'Not at all keen on the skin tones which are far too red, I''d have attempted some colour balancing in PS. If you''re going to have hands in a shot of a musician, don''t chop the fingers off. Trumpeter''s expression doesn''t seem particularly special here... wait for a moment of chemistry when he emotes during a special passage during the music. It''s unimaginative and easy to crop so close... I want to see a sense of context... where is he playing, where is he?', '2005-08-17 07:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617082, 218814, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great candid, I love his expression. Shame it''s a little overexposed. I also think it could do with more shadow tones.</td>', 'Great candid, I love his expression. Shame it''s a little overexposed. I also think it could do with more shadow tones.', '2005-08-17 07:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617084, 218667, 23394, '<td valign="top">yes, music to my ears, as well.  however, i don''t think this will be treated kindly by most voters...</td>', 'yes, music to my ears, as well.  however, i don''t think this will be treated kindly by most voters...', '2005-08-17 07:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617088, 218665, 23394, '<td valign="top">please don''t take your final score or the comments personally.  everybody has to start somewhere.</td>', 'please don''t take your final score or the comments personally.  everybody has to start somewhere.', '2005-08-17 07:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617089, 217443, 8522, '<td valign="top">You''ve caught a nice moment, but the background is way too cluttered. Tough shooting conditions for gig photography though... direct sunlight, ouch! It''s the other performer on the left that spoils the shot... the eye is led out of the frame and the chopped off guitar neck doesn''t work too well.</td>', 'You''ve caught a nice moment, but the background is way too cluttered. Tough shooting conditions for gig photography though... direct sunlight, ouch! It''s the other performer on the left that spoils the shot... the eye is led out of the frame and the chopped off guitar neck doesn''t work too well.', '2005-08-17 07:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617091, 216245, 23394, '<td valign="top">lovely image, but probably a bit too ''out of the box'' to score high.</td>', 'lovely image, but probably a bit too ''out of the box'' to score high.', '2005-08-17 07:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617092, 217791, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very odd effect... is this smoke, or a reflection through glass? I''m not really sure it works here.</td>', 'Very odd effect... is this smoke, or a reflection through glass? I''m not really sure it works here.', '2005-08-17 07:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
