(1617108, 218451, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful image, nicely observed.  if it is not scoring highly, it is probably because it is a bit too out-of-the-box...</td>', 'beautiful image, nicely observed.  if it is not scoring highly, it is probably because it is a bit too out-of-the-box...', '2005-08-17 07:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617112, 217256, 23394, '<td valign="top">great shot, especially the colors.  it is so peaceful, i can almost hear the chorus of ''dnmc'' in the background...</td>', 'great shot, especially the colors.  it is so peaceful, i can almost hear the chorus of ''dnmc'' in the background...', '2005-08-17 07:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617115, 217665, 39825, '<td valign="top">;-)</td>', ';-)', '2005-08-17 07:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617118, 219066, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting setup for a shot, but the execution could use some work.  a bit over-exposed, and not very sharp.</td>', 'interesting setup for a shot, but the execution could use some work.  a bit over-exposed, and not very sharp.', '2005-08-17 07:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617119, 218618, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see much more of a sense of context, ie more of the audience rather than just some feet, otherwise it''s really difficult to know what''s going on. Did you check the histogram after taking the shot? It looks like the shadow tones aren''t dark enough. Also, direct onboard flash is the work of the devil and makes shots look like snapshots.</td>', 'I''d love to see much more of a sense of context, ie more of the audience rather than just some feet, otherwise it''s really difficult to know what''s going on. Did you check the histogram after taking the shot? It looks like the shadow tones aren''t dark enough. Also, direct onboard flash is the work of the devil and makes shots look like snapshots.', '2005-08-17 07:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617120, 217652, 29474, '<td valign="top">Great photo. It would have been nice to have he whole head and a crop of about a cm on the left. How would it look in B&amp;W?</td>', 'Great photo. It would have been nice to have he whole head and a crop of about a cm on the left. How would it look in B&W?', '2005-08-17 07:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617124, 218052, 40338, '<td valign="top">too much clutter</td>', 'too much clutter', '2005-08-17 07:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617125, 218464, 40338, '<td valign="top">beautiful setting, has a really nice feeling about it</td>', 'beautiful setting, has a really nice feeling about it', '2005-08-17 07:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617128, 217487, 8522, '<td valign="top">Redeye... ouch. Composition doesn''t seem thought out at all... all the people on the left of the frame lead the viewer''s eye out of the shot because of the direction they''re going in. Unless you were there, it''s impossible to know what was going on, the photo doesn''t tell me a clear story. Too much background detail makes it hard to know where we''re supposed to be focusing on.</td>', 'Redeye... ouch. Composition doesn''t seem thought out at all... all the people on the left of the frame lead the viewer''s eye out of the shot because of the direction they''re going in. Unless you were there, it''s impossible to know what was going on, the photo doesn''t tell me a clear story. Too much background detail makes it hard to know where we''re supposed to be focusing on.', '2005-08-17 07:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617130, 218820, 8522, '<td valign="top">Promising, but the image is way too small here. Ask in the forums if you''re not sure how to get a 640x image submitted.</td>', 'Promising, but the image is way too small here. Ask in the forums if you''re not sure how to get a 640x image submitted.', '2005-08-17 07:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617131, 217240, 40338, '<td valign="top">lovely feeling but very dark</td>', 'lovely feeling but very dark', '2005-08-17 07:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617132, 218700, 8522, '<td valign="top">Just too noisy, and the quality of the grain doesn''t work well here.</td>', 'Just too noisy, and the quality of the grain doesn''t work well here.', '2005-08-17 07:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617133, 217369, 29348, '<td valign="top">very funny!</td>', 'very funny!', '2005-08-17 07:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
