(1617153, 218552, 8522, '<td valign="top">I really don''t think this is live music. Music is an organised collection of notes, he''s just picking out random notes. Light is very haphazard, glare off the piano takes the eye away from the boy. Too much background clutter.</td>', 'I really don''t think this is live music. Music is an organised collection of notes, he''s just picking out random notes. Light is very haphazard, glare off the piano takes the eye away from the boy. Too much background clutter.', '2005-08-17 07:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
