(1617174, 217145, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, you have a decent camera, and you are in a place where people are performing.  did you not have enough time to wait for them to actually be playing, or did you miss the performance?  it seems like this would have been a great opportunity to nail the challenge with a shot of ''live'' music...<br/> <br/>if you aren''t happy with your score you might want to check out this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thread</a>.</td>', 'ok, you have a decent camera, and you are in a place where people are performing.  did you not have enough time to wait for them to actually be playing, or did you miss the performance?  it seems like this would have been a great opportunity to nail the challenge with a shot of ''live'' music... if you aren''t happy with your score you might want to check out this thread.', '2005-08-17 08:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617176, 218566, 15648, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but grainy. You could fix that using a median on it.</td>', 'Nice composition but grainy. You could fix that using a median on it.', '2005-08-17 08:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617178, 217943, 39900, '<td valign="top">Ugly guy but great shot. Love the contrast and the effect in this picture<br/>Give u 8 :)</td>', 'Ugly guy but great shot. Love the contrast and the effect in this pictureGive u 8 :)', '2005-08-17 08:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617179, 218664, 15648, '<td valign="top">Nice efeect</td>', 'Nice efeect', '2005-08-17 08:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617180, 217522, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful image, absolutely.  lovely composition, and i don''t mind the blowouts that much.  however, i can''t imagine this scoring well, given how out-of-the-box it is.  if you aren''t happy with your score you might want to check out this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thread</a>.</td>', 'beautiful image, absolutely.  lovely composition, and i don''t mind the blowouts that much.  however, i can''t imagine this scoring well, given how out-of-the-box it is.  if you aren''t happy with your score you might want to check out this thread.', '2005-08-17 08:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617182, 218664, 23394, '<td valign="top">almost too subtle.  if the viewers don''t spend enough time with this, it will not get the score you want.  nice effort, though.</td>', 'almost too subtle.  if the viewers don''t spend enough time with this, it will not get the score you want.  nice effort, though.', '2005-08-17 08:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617183, 217145, 8522, '<td valign="top">Composition is all over the place, person on left looking straight out of shot picking his nose with another person directly behind him really spoils it. Not sure what you were trying to achieve here.</td>', 'Composition is all over the place, person on left looking straight out of shot picking his nose with another person directly behind him really spoils it. Not sure what you were trying to achieve here.', '2005-08-17 08:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617184, 218464, 32818, '<td valign="top">nice picture.., and especially, very nice subject..! Say hi to her..;)</td>', 'nice picture.., and especially, very nice subject..! Say hi to her..;)', '2005-08-17 08:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617185, 217801, 38508, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!!! Really worth a Ribbon!!</td>', 'Great shot!!!! Really worth a Ribbon!!', '2005-08-17 08:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617187, 217819, 15648, '<td valign="top">You must have 2 submissions of this women, I like this one best.<br/>Go to my website: www.LegatoMuzicPhotography.com<br/>to view concert photo''s</td>', 'You must have 2 submissions of this women, I like this one best.Go to my website: www.LegatoMuzicPhotography.comto view concert photo''s', '2005-08-17 08:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617188, 218610, 23394, '<td valign="top">cute, but looking a bit over-sharpened.  very interesting take on the challenge, can''t wait to see how this finishes up.</td>', 'cute, but looking a bit over-sharpened.  very interesting take on the challenge, can''t wait to see how this finishes up.', '2005-08-17 08:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617189, 216618, 8522, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a bit soft. Never a good thing to chop fingers off if you''re going to try and include hands of a performer in a shot. Composition seems unbalanced, background is distracting.</td>', 'Focus seems a bit soft. Never a good thing to chop fingers off if you''re going to try and include hands of a performer in a shot. Composition seems unbalanced, background is distracting.', '2005-08-17 08:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617190, 217943, 15648, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Looks like you are in the same buisness as me. <br/> <br/> <br/>www.LegatoMuzicPhotography.com</td>', 'Nice composition. Looks like you are in the same buisness as me.   www.LegatoMuzicPhotography.com', '2005-08-17 08:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617191, 217426, 29348, '<td valign="top">are you sure this is legal?</td>', 'are you sure this is legal?', '2005-08-17 08:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617192, 218666, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting attempt to liven up the shot with a tilted angle, but I feel dizzy looking at it. Great expression. If you want to keep the angle, I''d have moved him to the top-left corner of the shot to balance the composition out.</td>', 'Interesting attempt to liven up the shot with a tilted angle, but I feel dizzy looking at it. Great expression. If you want to keep the angle, I''d have moved him to the top-left corner of the shot to balance the composition out.', '2005-08-17 08:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617194, 217240, 8522, '<td valign="top">Too much like a snapshot... you''ve captured live music and an audience but I can''t see any thought about the composition. Where do you want the viewer''s eye to rest? Are the performers important? It takes a second look to notice them, as they''re pretty dark.</td>', 'Too much like a snapshot... you''ve captured live music and an audience but I can''t see any thought about the composition. Where do you want the viewer''s eye to rest? Are the performers important? It takes a second look to notice them, as they''re pretty dark.', '2005-08-17 08:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617196, 217529, 8522, '<td valign="top">If this was live music, you''d really be getting in the way of the audience. I can''t imagine getting this close and in the way of a live gig.</td>', 'If this was live music, you''d really be getting in the way of the audience. I can''t imagine getting this close and in the way of a live gig.', '2005-08-17 08:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617199, 216714, 23394, '<td valign="top">plugged in, yes, but turned on and being put to use?  challenge aside, a guitar can be a great subject, but you need a strong focal point and composition.  this could also be a bit sharper.</td>', 'plugged in, yes, but turned on and being put to use?  challenge aside, a guitar can be a great subject, but you need a strong focal point and composition.  this could also be a bit sharper.', '2005-08-17 08:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617200, 218845, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nicely done... I can''t give it a REALLY high mark as ''Live Music'' suggests an audience and this is obviously a set up shot, but it is well carried out. It could be quite a bit sharper though, maybe with some gaussian blur to remove jaggies.</td>', 'Nicely done... I can''t give it a REALLY high mark as ''Live Music'' suggests an audience and this is obviously a set up shot, but it is well carried out. It could be quite a bit sharper though, maybe with some gaussian blur to remove jaggies.', '2005-08-17 08:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617202, 219020, 8522, '<td valign="top">Your subject is great, but the composition seems off... why is the recorder right by the edge of the frame, but the head has plenty of space? Surely it should be the other way round? I''m personally missing the elbows... perhaps portrait orientation? The background is terrible... how would it have looked if you got right by the wall and shot her profile without the brick wall behind her?</td>', 'Your subject is great, but the composition seems off... why is the recorder right by the edge of the frame, but the head has plenty of space? Surely it should be the other way round? I''m personally missing the elbows... perhaps portrait orientation? The background is terrible... how would it have looked if you got right by the wall and shot her profile without the brick wall behind her?', '2005-08-17 08:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617208, 218725, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... I would ideally have liked him on the left of the frame though. Shame his expression is a bit tame bearing in mind his rock n'' roll pose.</td>', 'Nice shot... I would ideally have liked him on the left of the frame though. Shame his expression is a bit tame bearing in mind his rock n'' roll pose.', '2005-08-17 08:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617209, 218599, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but really not in the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but really not in the spirit of the challenge.', '2005-08-17 08:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617210, 218839, 8522, '<td valign="top">Is this guy a musician? Prove it!</td>', 'Is this guy a musician? Prove it!', '2005-08-17 08:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617212, 217967, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but doesn''t say live music to me. I would laugh him off his window posed like that.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but doesn''t say live music to me. I would laugh him off his window posed like that.', '2005-08-17 08:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617217, 218535, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame the photo is so small, it''s difficult to figure out what it going on.</td>', 'Shame the photo is so small, it''s difficult to figure out what it going on.', '2005-08-17 08:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617218, 218615, 23394, '<td valign="top">i once heard a guy describing another photographer as one of the best he had ever seen.  he said the guy''s pictures were so telling, they didn''t need captions.  and that''s my goal:  to shoot images that fit a story and tell a story <i>without a caption</i>.  to me, the <i>challenge</i> of dpc is to produce an image that there is no question about whether or not it fits.<br/> <br/>here, you have a snapshot of a child with his mouth open.  is he singing, smiling, or yelling?  it''s an interesting composition, but there is not telling what that is in front of his face that is catching the flash and throwing the shadow.  the colors are interesting.<br/> <br/>if you aren''t happy with your score you might want to check out this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thread</a>.</td>', 'i once heard a guy describing another photographer as one of the best he had ever seen.  he said the guy''s pictures were so telling, they didn''t need captions.  and that''s my goal:  to shoot images that fit a story and tell a story without a caption.  to me, the challenge of dpc is to produce an image that there is no question about whether or not it fits. here, you have a snapshot of a child with his mouth open.  is he singing, smiling, or yelling?  it''s an interesting composition, but there is not telling what that is in front of his face that is catching the flash and throwing the shadow.  the colors are interesting. if you aren''t happy with your score you might want to check out this thread.', '2005-08-17 08:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617221, 218838, 8522, '<td valign="top">Ouch, why cut his left hand fingers off? It''s usually not a good thing when the eyes are near the edge of the frame looking out of it... it leads the viewer''s eye out of the shot.</td>', 'Ouch, why cut his left hand fingers off? It''s usually not a good thing when the eyes are near the edge of the frame looking out of it... it leads the viewer''s eye out of the shot.', '2005-08-17 08:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617224, 217508, 37719, '<td valign="top">The problem I have with this is that it could be anyone with some junk on their face looking silly.  Other than your title there is nothing to indicate that this is an actual singer performing.</td>', 'The problem I have with this is that it could be anyone with some junk on their face looking silly.  Other than your title there is nothing to indicate that this is an actual singer performing.', '2005-08-17 08:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617225, 218726, 8522, '<td valign="top">Why use this terrible gratuitous filter? BTW, it''s spelt ''Bass''. Shadows behind the performer make it look a bit like a snapshot.</td>', 'Why use this terrible gratuitous filter? BTW, it''s spelt ''Bass''. Shadows behind the performer make it look a bit like a snapshot.', '2005-08-17 08:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617226, 218974, 37719, '<td valign="top">How is this live music?</td>', 'How is this live music?', '2005-08-17 08:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617227, 216946, 8522, '<td valign="top">With a sax player, the hands are almost as important as the face... the OOF hand bothers me as does the fact that the other hand is missing altogether. Nice light though.</td>', 'With a sax player, the hands are almost as important as the face... the OOF hand bothers me as does the fact that the other hand is missing altogether. Nice light though.', '2005-08-17 08:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617228, 217256, 37719, '<td valign="top">Live music?</td>', 'Live music?', '2005-08-17 08:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617229, 218428, 8522, '<td valign="top">Are you joking?</td>', 'Are you joking?', '2005-08-17 08:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617231, 218370, 23394, '<td valign="top">yes, vibrating guitar strings produce sound...but what were you hoping for here?  that most voters would go along with you to consider ''sound'' ''live music''?  it''s a nice enough image, but quite a bit of a stretch...</td>', 'yes, vibrating guitar strings produce sound...but what were you hoping for here?  that most voters would go along with you to consider ''sound'' ''live music''?  it''s a nice enough image, but quite a bit of a stretch...', '2005-08-17 08:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617235, 216452, 8522, '<td valign="top">If this was live music and I was in the audience, I would be bothered by this obtrusive photographer. Your light source has overexposed the performer''s head, turning this into a snapshot. White balance seems off... everything is too blue. Keyboard doesn''t look deliberately wonky.</td>', 'If this was live music and I was in the audience, I would be bothered by this obtrusive photographer. Your light source has overexposed the performer''s head, turning this into a snapshot. White balance seems off... everything is too blue. Keyboard doesn''t look deliberately wonky.', '2005-08-17 08:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617236, 217369, 23394, '<td valign="top">''live music''?  being performed by paper-mache dolls that include two dead people?  interesting <strike>stretch</strike> take on the challenge.  lighting is ok, but the image could be a bit sharper.<br/> <br/>if you aren''t happy with your score you might want to check out this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thread</a>.</td>', '''live music''?  being performed by paper-mache dolls that include two dead people?  interesting stretch take on the challenge.  lighting is ok, but the image could be a bit sharper. if you aren''t happy with your score you might want to check out this thread.', '2005-08-17 08:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617237, 218490, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oh, so almost. The microphone stuck in the side of her head, like an unhappy audience member just had enough and couldn''t take any more, stabbing her in the head lets this down badly. White balance seems a bit off.</td>', 'Oh, so almost. The microphone stuck in the side of her head, like an unhappy audience member just had enough and couldn''t take any more, stabbing her in the head lets this down badly. White balance seems a bit off.', '2005-08-17 08:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
