(1617300, 218048, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very strange expression on performer''s face. I''m missing his right hand... I think the hands on sax players are important. Onboard flash has given very unflattering shadows which make shot look like a snapshot. Background looks awful. Very noisy, surely with flash a lower ISO could have been used?</td>', 'Very strange expression on performer''s face. I''m missing his right hand... I think the hands on sax players are important. Onboard flash has given very unflattering shadows which make shot look like a snapshot. Background looks awful. Very noisy, surely with flash a lower ISO could have been used?', '2005-08-17 08:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
