(1617413, 219059, 8522, '<td valign="top">I can see dodging/burning around the subject (especially when I tilt my laptop screen) and guitar case. I heavily doubt this was basic editing. Nonetheless, I will vote as if it was legal.</td>', 'I can see dodging/burning around the subject (especially when I tilt my laptop screen) and guitar case. I heavily doubt this was basic editing. Nonetheless, I will vote as if it was legal.', '2005-08-17 09:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617417, 217552, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite look intentionally blurry. A little oversaturated for my taste, with too many unnatural purples.</td>', 'Doesn''t quite look intentionally blurry. A little oversaturated for my taste, with too many unnatural purples.', '2005-08-17 09:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617420, 218873, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really say live music to me. I''d prefer the focus on the face rather than on the headstock. Or on both.</td>', 'Doesn''t really say live music to me. I''d prefer the focus on the face rather than on the headstock. Or on both.', '2005-08-17 09:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617421, 218665, 8522, '<td valign="top">Photo size too small. Flash has meant that out attention is pulled to audience rather than band, and makes it look like a snapshot.</td>', 'Photo size too small. Flash has meant that out attention is pulled to audience rather than band, and makes it look like a snapshot.', '2005-08-17 09:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617424, 218213, 33352, '<td valign="top">The contrast of colors is very good,would have liked to have seen the subject a little closer...7</td>', 'The contrast of colors is very good,would have liked to have seen the subject a little closer...7', '2005-08-17 09:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617426, 216762, 40569, '<td valign="top">Nice link!</td>', 'Nice link!', '2005-08-17 09:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617427, 217586, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, not usually the best place for a plectrum (over fingerboard). Anyway, I like the selective desat but the onboard flash (work of the devil) has really spoilt the shot, look at the shadows under the fingers.</td>', 'Wow, not usually the best place for a plectrum (over fingerboard). Anyway, I like the selective desat but the onboard flash (work of the devil) has really spoilt the shot, look at the shadows under the fingers.', '2005-08-17 09:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617433, 216728, 8522, '<td valign="top">You did well to keep detail in the performer as well as the lamps. Tilted composition works well. Some basic editing desaturation has resulted in strange bright blue strips over your photo which spoil the effect. Would it have been better as it was?</td>', 'You did well to keep detail in the performer as well as the lamps. Tilted composition works well. Some basic editing desaturation has resulted in strange bright blue strips over your photo which spoil the effect. Would it have been better as it was?', '2005-08-17 09:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617437, 218960, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nothing about this suggests live music to me.</td>', 'Nothing about this suggests live music to me.', '2005-08-17 09:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617439, 217950, 27503, '<td valign="top">Brought smile to my face - nice picture! :-)</td>', 'Brought smile to my face - nice picture! :-)', '2005-08-17 09:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617442, 218612, 8522, '<td valign="top">You see arty, I see out of focus with the wrong white balance.</td>', 'You see arty, I see out of focus with the wrong white balance.', '2005-08-17 09:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617445, 216245, 8522, '<td valign="top">Way to shoehorn! 1</td>', 'Way to shoehorn! 1', '2005-08-17 09:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617446, 217819, 42341, '<td valign="top">Great composition and very nice B/W work!</td>', 'Great composition and very nice B/W work!', '2005-08-17 09:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617452, 216960, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice moment. If you''re going to include most of the elbow, include the whole thing! The lighting here isn''t especially flattering to him, I''d have removed most of the purple in PS.</td>', 'Nice moment. If you''re going to include most of the elbow, include the whole thing! The lighting here isn''t especially flattering to him, I''d have removed most of the purple in PS.', '2005-08-17 09:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617456, 217170, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice candid, not sure about the slightly tilted camera angle. Missing an extra something I can''t really put my finger on.</td>', 'Nice candid, not sure about the slightly tilted camera angle. Missing an extra something I can''t really put my finger on.', '2005-08-17 09:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617459, 216608, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, and interesting composition. How come this is so noisy though? It looks like you could have used a much lower ISO. The guitar in the foreground spoils the shot.</td>', 'Beautiful colours, and interesting composition. How come this is so noisy though? It looks like you could have used a much lower ISO. The guitar in the foreground spoils the shot.', '2005-08-17 09:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617464, 218910, 8522, '<td valign="top">She looks a right state, very entertaining. Centred composition seems very unimaginative. I would like you to have gone closer and made more of her, it''s difficult to pick out much detail at this focal length and the background is too distracting.</td>', 'She looks a right state, very entertaining. Centred composition seems very unimaginative. I would like you to have gone closer and made more of her, it''s difficult to pick out much detail at this focal length and the background is too distracting.', '2005-08-17 09:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617465, 218063, 30608, '<td valign="top">This shot could be her album cover. What steps this one up from others in the challenge is this does not look like a snapshot. Very nicely done.</td>', 'This shot could be her album cover. What steps this one up from others in the challenge is this does not look like a snapshot. Very nicely done.', '2005-08-17 09:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617466, 218667, 39833, '<td valign="top">Cool picture, but way out off the challenge topic.</td>', 'Cool picture, but way out off the challenge topic.', '2005-08-17 09:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617467, 218451, 39833, '<td valign="top">Cool picture, but way out off the challenge topic.</td>', 'Cool picture, but way out off the challenge topic.', '2005-08-17 09:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617472, 219059, 39833, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. What''s the problem with the background?</td>', 'Nice shot. What''s the problem with the background?', '2005-08-17 09:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617513, 216762, 39833, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but kind of out off topic...</td>', 'Nice photo, but kind of out off topic...', '2005-08-17 10:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617517, 218555, 27991, '<td valign="top">I know your title is BLUES, but i think there is too much blue sky... takes away from the man.</td>', 'I know your title is BLUES, but i think there is too much blue sky... takes away from the man.', '2005-08-17 10:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617518, 216944, 27991, '<td valign="top">This picture is very dark It is hard to tell what that is on your sides....</td>', 'This picture is very dark It is hard to tell what that is on your sides....', '2005-08-17 10:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617522, 218612, 27991, '<td valign="top">what is this a picture of? way too blurry.</td>', 'what is this a picture of? way too blurry.', '2005-08-17 10:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617525, 218566, 27991, '<td valign="top">clean and crisp. nice job</td>', 'clean and crisp. nice job', '2005-08-17 10:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617527, 218451, 27991, '<td valign="top">Its different. Very creative. nice job.</td>', 'Its different. Very creative. nice job.', '2005-08-17 10:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617529, 217390, 27991, '<td valign="top">Nice pic. i like the way the man is sweating... it makes it looked not set up.</td>', 'Nice pic. i like the way the man is sweating... it makes it looked not set up.', '2005-08-17 10:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617532, 217378, 27991, '<td valign="top">too bad is hand is blurry. it almost looks like a crazy bird trying to take flight. The people in the back round are a nice touch. well done. 7</td>', 'too bad is hand is blurry. it almost looks like a crazy bird trying to take flight. The people in the back round are a nice touch. well done. 7', '2005-08-17 10:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617533, 219059, 27991, '<td valign="top">why is there a halo like glow around the person??</td>', 'why is there a halo like glow around the person??', '2005-08-17 10:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617535, 218667, 27991, '<td valign="top">Creative... i like it. 7</td>', 'Creative... i like it. 7', '2005-08-17 10:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617536, 218316, 8522, '<td valign="top">IMO too dark/underexposed and the skin tone is too red. Shots of performers usually do better when their eyes are open, there''s nothing particularly special about his expression here.</td>', 'IMO too dark/underexposed and the skin tone is too red. Shots of performers usually do better when their eyes are open, there''s nothing particularly special about his expression here.', '2005-08-17 10:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617538, 218845, 27991, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... i tried this with my son and it just didnt work. nice job. 9</td>', 'Beautiful... i tried this with my son and it just didnt work. nice job. 9', '2005-08-17 10:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617542, 217556, 27991, '<td valign="top">thats great :)</td>', 'thats great :)', '2005-08-17 10:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617544, 219008, 8522, '<td valign="top">As an aside, the pianist''s technique and hand position is just terrible. The shot comes across as a snapshot... the wall next to the piano looks bad and the reflection of the performer in the piano doesn''t work well at all. Nothing about this shot suggests a live performance to me. Composition doesn''t do a lot for me.</td>', 'As an aside, the pianist''s technique and hand position is just terrible. The shot comes across as a snapshot... the wall next to the piano looks bad and the reflection of the performer in the piano doesn''t work well at all. Nothing about this shot suggests a live performance to me. Composition doesn''t do a lot for me.', '2005-08-17 10:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617546, 219066, 27991, '<td valign="top">This is great. The only thing i notice is the sunset is glaring onto him. if it was a bit softer this pic would be a 10, 9 isnt bad either. :)</td>', 'This is great. The only thing i notice is the sunset is glaring onto him. if it was a bit softer this pic would be a 10, 9 isnt bad either. :)', '2005-08-17 10:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617550, 216557, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice atmosphere, I really wish there was a little more shadow detail though. I''d also like the silhouette to be clearer.</td>', 'Very nice atmosphere, I really wish there was a little more shadow detail though. I''d also like the silhouette to be clearer.', '2005-08-17 10:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617552, 217425, 27991, '<td valign="top">Is he drooling?</td>', 'Is he drooling?', '2005-08-17 10:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617553, 217856, 27107, '<td valign="top">10 all the way! coming back to say this is going straight to my favs!</td>', '10 all the way! coming back to say this is going straight to my favs!', '2005-08-17 10:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617554, 218599, 40580, '<td valign="top">Neat effect and witty take on the challenge.</td>', 'Neat effect and witty take on the challenge.', '2005-08-17 10:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617555, 218324, 27991, '<td valign="top">by the look of his eyes hes telling a quite a tale with his harmonica. 10</td>', 'by the look of his eyes hes telling a quite a tale with his harmonica. 10', '2005-08-17 10:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617556, 218884, 40580, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness.  What an "interesting" subject and he''s blind too.</td>', 'Oh my goodness.  What an "interesting" subject and he''s blind too.', '2005-08-17 10:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617558, 217464, 27991, '<td valign="top">very gray overtone.... the blast of blue on his shirt is almost distracting.</td>', 'very gray overtone.... the blast of blue on his shirt is almost distracting.', '2005-08-17 10:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617559, 217606, 8522, '<td valign="top">The horizon seems to be at just the wrong place, I''d have got slightly higher or lower to maximise the position of the background. Tough exposure, the face seems slightly too dark but I understand you''d be in danger of blowing the highlights if you''d let more light in. Still, I''m sure there''s something more that could have been done with curves. I''d also have desaturated some red to make his skin tone more flattering. What''s the streak at the top left corner of the shot? Composition feels slightly unbalanced, I think we need a little more sax.</td>', 'The horizon seems to be at just the wrong place, I''d have got slightly higher or lower to maximise the position of the background. Tough exposure, the face seems slightly too dark but I understand you''d be in danger of blowing the highlights if you''d let more light in. Still, I''m sure there''s something more that could have been done with curves. I''d also have desaturated some red to make his skin tone more flattering. What''s the streak at the top left corner of the shot? Composition feels slightly unbalanced, I think we need a little more sax.', '2005-08-17 10:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617560, 218490, 40580, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2005-08-17 10:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617561, 218956, 40580, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2005-08-17 10:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617565, 218665, 40580, '<td valign="top">Bigger picture please.</td>', 'Bigger picture please.', '2005-08-17 10:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617567, 218464, 18191, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the answer to that question but all I know is that this is an absolutely beautiful image!</td>', 'I don''t know the answer to that question but all I know is that this is an absolutely beautiful image!', '2005-08-17 10:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617570, 217856, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great intensity, I love this shot --- really top notch work. Congrats.</td>', 'Great intensity, I love this shot --- really top notch work. Congrats.', '2005-08-17 10:32:45.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1617571, 218584, 8522, '<td valign="top">The look on the guitarist''s face suggests that he has been asked to pose, and is not in full flow of a song. He''s just too self-conscious. Background hasn''t really been thought through enough, it''s too distracting and the burnt out sky spoils it. The leaves growing out of his head are also a no-no.</td>', 'The look on the guitarist''s face suggests that he has been asked to pose, and is not in full flow of a song. He''s just too self-conscious. Background hasn''t really been thought through enough, it''s too distracting and the burnt out sky spoils it. The leaves growing out of his head are also a no-no.', '2005-08-17 10:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617574, 218430, 8522, '<td valign="top">Background is too distracting, especially the people in the window. If you''re going to include most of the pan pipes, include the whole lot! Shame about the watch. Nothing seems particularly sharp.</td>', 'Background is too distracting, especially the people in the window. If you''re going to include most of the pan pipes, include the whole lot! Shame about the watch. Nothing seems particularly sharp.', '2005-08-17 10:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617579, 218867, 40580, '<td valign="top">There''s a green cast to the picture.  I''m not certain you wanted it to look green.</td>', 'There''s a green cast to the picture.  I''m not certain you wanted it to look green.', '2005-08-17 10:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617583, 219020, 40580, '<td valign="top">Those eyes are striking.</td>', 'Those eyes are striking.', '2005-08-17 10:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617588, 217432, 40580, '<td valign="top">Striking picture.  Great boken.</td>', 'Striking picture.  Great boken.', '2005-08-17 10:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617589, 216663, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, I like this. Great composition, but I''d have pointed the camera so his head observed rule of thirds. Here, there''s just too much negative space at the top, but being near the bass body has given the shot much dynamism. White balance seems a little off, in PS I''d have adjusted the colour balance to give less orange/yellow. Love the lights in the background. I like the motion blur, but nothing is sharp enough. A little flash could really have helped to freeze the action here, as long as enough ambient light still made it.</td>', 'Oh yes, I like this. Great composition, but I''d have pointed the camera so his head observed rule of thirds. Here, there''s just too much negative space at the top, but being near the bass body has given the shot much dynamism. White balance seems a little off, in PS I''d have adjusted the colour balance to give less orange/yellow. Love the lights in the background. I like the motion blur, but nothing is sharp enough. A little flash could really have helped to freeze the action here, as long as enough ambient light still made it.', '2005-08-17 10:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617591, 218138, 40580, '<td valign="top">Witty take on the challenge.</td>', 'Witty take on the challenge.', '2005-08-17 10:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617593, 218667, 40580, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but pink floyd wasn''t a race car driver.  I would''ve rated higher, but the colors are dull.  You need to make them pop more.  Maybe also crop out the people in the back.</td>', 'Nice try, but pink floyd wasn''t a race car driver.  I would''ve rated higher, but the colors are dull.  You need to make them pop more.  Maybe also crop out the people in the back.', '2005-08-17 10:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617594, 218521, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really say live music to me. The books are much too distracting a background. Onboard flash which is the work of the devil has given bad shadows and given a snapshot look. Slightly overexposed. I like the tilted composition. Seeing as you used flash, you could have closed the aperture a little and given yourself more dof (as long as you had a simple background).</td>', 'Doesn''t really say live music to me. The books are much too distracting a background. Onboard flash which is the work of the devil has given bad shadows and given a snapshot look. Slightly overexposed. I like the tilted composition. Seeing as you used flash, you could have closed the aperture a little and given yourself more dof (as long as you had a simple background).', '2005-08-17 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617595, 217804, 40580, '<td valign="top">Did you intentionally mean to tilt the picture clockwise?  It''s very un-nerving for me.</td>', 'Did you intentionally mean to tilt the picture clockwise?  It''s very un-nerving for me.', '2005-08-17 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617597, 219023, 40580, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I also like the odd angle.</td>', 'Great colors.  I also like the odd angle.', '2005-08-17 10:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617599, 217511, 40580, '<td valign="top">Great expressions.  It''s a little green, but I was probably the lighting on stage.  So hard to control someone else''s lighting.</td>', 'Great expressions.  It''s a little green, but I was probably the lighting on stage.  So hard to control someone else''s lighting.', '2005-08-17 10:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617600, 218597, 40580, '<td valign="top">Great boken.</td>', 'Great boken.', '2005-08-17 10:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617601, 218464, 40580, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you included the title, I wouldn''t have gotten it otherwise.</td>', 'I''m glad you included the title, I wouldn''t have gotten it otherwise.', '2005-08-17 10:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617602, 217867, 40580, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Maybe B&amp;W also?</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Maybe B&W also?', '2005-08-17 10:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617606, 218726, 40580, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the painted effect.  Sorry.</td>', 'I don''t like the painted effect.  Sorry.', '2005-08-17 10:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617607, 216762, 40580, '<td valign="top">Out of focus?</td>', 'Out of focus?', '2005-08-17 10:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617611, 218046, 40580, '<td valign="top">Soft focus.  Would''ve been better sharper.</td>', 'Soft focus.  Would''ve been better sharper.', '2005-08-17 10:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617614, 217426, 40580, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t like this effect.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t like this effect.', '2005-08-17 10:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617619, 217256, 38648, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but I don''t see what this has to do with the Challenge of Live Music</td>', 'Nice picture, but I don''t see what this has to do with the Challenge of Live Music', '2005-08-17 10:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617620, 218341, 3569, '<td valign="top">lets see the fiddle</td>', 'lets see the fiddle', '2005-08-17 10:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617625, 218324, 3569, '<td valign="top">nice sharp photo.</td>', 'nice sharp photo.', '2005-08-17 10:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617628, 219011, 40820, '<td valign="top">a bit new to all this...but...does this shot conform to the rules of "basic editing"?</td>', 'a bit new to all this...but...does this shot conform to the rules of "basic editing"?', '2005-08-17 10:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617629, 218851, 3569, '<td valign="top">great contrasts</td>', 'great contrasts', '2005-08-17 10:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617631, 217724, 3569, '<td valign="top">to many hot spots to me</td>', 'to many hot spots to me', '2005-08-17 10:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617636, 218478, 3569, '<td valign="top">great lighting and crop</td>', 'great lighting and crop', '2005-08-17 10:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617643, 218713, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot with superb composition, but there''s a very strange filtered effect I don''t like at all. Shame, as otherwise it''s one of the better drummer photos I''ve come across.</td>', 'Wonderful shot with superb composition, but there''s a very strange filtered effect I don''t like at all. Shame, as otherwise it''s one of the better drummer photos I''ve come across.', '2005-08-17 10:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617645, 217432, 3569, '<td valign="top">wonderful in all ways.</td>', 'wonderful in all ways.', '2005-08-17 10:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617646, 216797, 3569, '<td valign="top">ya cut her feet off.</td>', 'ya cut her feet off.', '2005-08-17 10:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617647, 217256, 3569, '<td valign="top">nice buffalo, but unless it is ripping one, I see no live music.</td>', 'nice buffalo, but unless it is ripping one, I see no live music.', '2005-08-17 10:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617649, 217939, 3569, '<td valign="top">to much darkroom to me</td>', 'to much darkroom to me', '2005-08-17 10:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617650, 216813, 8522, '<td valign="top">Kids dancing to music can make for great photos, the composition lets this down though. The trumpeter is too near the top edge of the frame and everything feels unbalanced. I do think this could have benefited from observing rule of thirds. Stepping back and placing the trumpeter and kid on thirds junctions would have made it much stronger. Not fond of the sepia effect. Nothing is in focus enough. Why the square crop? It hasn''t helped you here, and you''d do better to get the right composition straight out of the camera.</td>', 'Kids dancing to music can make for great photos, the composition lets this down though. The trumpeter is too near the top edge of the frame and everything feels unbalanced. I do think this could have benefited from observing rule of thirds. Stepping back and placing the trumpeter and kid on thirds junctions would have made it much stronger. Not fond of the sepia effect. Nothing is in focus enough. Why the square crop? It hasn''t helped you here, and you''d do better to get the right composition straight out of the camera.', '2005-08-17 10:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617652, 217508, 3569, '<td valign="top">or tarzan''s little brother?</td>', 'or tarzan''s little brother?', '2005-08-17 10:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617655, 216618, 37961, '<td valign="top">Classic. Beautiful lighting. 10</td>', 'Classic. Beautiful lighting. 10', '2005-08-17 10:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617656, 218665, 3569, '<td valign="top">to small to see what''s happening.</td>', 'to small to see what''s happening.', '2005-08-17 10:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617657, 219110, 37961, '<td valign="top">Really clean shot. Excellent color tones and focus too. 10</td>', 'Really clean shot. Excellent color tones and focus too. 10', '2005-08-17 11:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617659, 218798, 3569, '<td valign="top">really grainy for a sunny day.  Overprocessing?</td>', 'really grainy for a sunny day.  Overprocessing?', '2005-08-17 11:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617665, 218891, 37961, '<td valign="top">Freaking Hilarious! 10</td>', 'Freaking Hilarious! 10', '2005-08-17 11:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617666, 219110, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot.  Shows movement without being blurred.</td>', 'Nice clear shot.  Shows movement without being blurred.', '2005-08-17 11:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617667, 219055, 35739, '<td valign="top">A tad underexposed on the subject? I like the content.  Good candid shot.</td>', 'A tad underexposed on the subject? I like the content.  Good candid shot.', '2005-08-17 11:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617668, 218666, 3569, '<td valign="top">nice shot, suckie angle IMO</td>', 'nice shot, suckie angle IMO', '2005-08-17 11:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617669, 218665, 35739, '<td valign="top">Too small and what I can see appears to be out of focus</td>', 'Too small and what I can see appears to be out of focus', '2005-08-17 11:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
