(1617825, 219110, 8522, '<td valign="top">So difficult to get good gig photos when the sun is casting a shadow with a baseball cap. It''s rarely effective to include half a hand at the edge of a shot. I''d have changed my position and tried to get more of her eyes. Ideally I''d have waited for her to look in a different direction, maybe inbetween songs so the sun didn''t cast a shadow in her eyes.</td>', 'So difficult to get good gig photos when the sun is casting a shadow with a baseball cap. It''s rarely effective to include half a hand at the edge of a shot. I''d have changed my position and tried to get more of her eyes. Ideally I''d have waited for her to look in a different direction, maybe inbetween songs so the sun didn''t cast a shadow in her eyes.', '2005-08-17 11:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
