(1617945, 217819, 19672, '<td valign="top">Great shot....the light looks like a sun.  Would be nice to see the mic a ways from the mouth but a minor imperfection. Good crop....maybe a little more or a little less to the right. But the light kinda precludes that. Good job. (8)</td>', 'Great shot....the light looks like a sun.  Would be nice to see the mic a ways from the mouth but a minor imperfection. Good crop....maybe a little more or a little less to the right. But the light kinda precludes that. Good job. (8)', '2005-08-17 12:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617946, 218370, 19672, '<td valign="top">Good use of strummed strings to denote that  this is live but not a very enticing photo. Would work nice as stock art.</td>', 'Good use of strummed strings to denote that  this is live but not a very enticing photo. Would work nice as stock art.', '2005-08-17 12:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617949, 217425, 19672, '<td valign="top">what is hanging out of his mouth????<br/> <br/>this is a hard one...I think this would have benefited from a narrow DOF so as to blur the people in the background.</td>', 'what is hanging out of his mouth???? this is a hard one...I think this would have benefited from a narrow DOF so as to blur the people in the background.', '2005-08-17 12:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617950, 218561, 19672, '<td valign="top">um...the background stage props are nice and add positive elements but they should not be the strongest elements.</td>', 'um...the background stage props are nice and add positive elements but they should not be the strongest elements.', '2005-08-17 12:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617954, 218641, 19746, '<td valign="top">Mightymite pickups!  Doesn''t communicate live music all that well to me but I guess not everyone had access to a live concert.  This shot is a little bland, for me and quite unbalanced compositionally due to the visible edge in bottom right.<br/> <br/>I don''t have many ideas on how to improve this shot...perhaps playing with a couple of angles and things, trying to find something dramatic...also, there appears to be a bit of noise which detracts from the image a little.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge<br/>Alex (5)</td>', 'Mightymite pickups!  Doesn''t communicate live music all that well to me but I guess not everyone had access to a live concert.  This shot is a little bland, for me and quite unbalanced compositionally due to the visible edge in bottom right. I don''t have many ideas on how to improve this shot...perhaps playing with a couple of angles and things, trying to find something dramatic...also, there appears to be a bit of noise which detracts from the image a little. Good luck in the challengeAlex (5)', '2005-08-17 12:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617958, 217256, 39038, '<td valign="top">Photo wise, this is another great photo from you. But it may be a bit off track to many western viewers. As an oriental, I knew why you chose this. The way we unstand the word of "Music" is a bit different than western world. I almost gone for a similar shot. I just hope this photo score well, since it is so oriental music type - slow pace and peaceful. I always enjoyed your photos. <br/> <br/>10 from me. now I am beating off my own entry....</td>', 'Photo wise, this is another great photo from you. But it may be a bit off track to many western viewers. As an oriental, I knew why you chose this. The way we unstand the word of "Music" is a bit different than western world. I almost gone for a similar shot. I just hope this photo score well, since it is so oriental music type - slow pace and peaceful. I always enjoyed your photos.  10 from me. now I am beating off my own entry....', '2005-08-17 12:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617965, 218800, 35739, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, a little over exposed.</td>', 'Nice capture, a little over exposed.', '2005-08-17 12:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617970, 217753, 30791, '<td valign="top">wtf?</td>', 'wtf?', '2005-08-17 12:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617971, 218726, 39038, '<td valign="top">I think this effect is not permitted by basic editing rules.</td>', 'I think this effect is not permitted by basic editing rules.', '2005-08-17 12:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617972, 218725, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is my blue ribbon winner.  The lighting in the back is great; both miminal, but exciting.  The expression of the musician is not "ordinary"; he certainly looks like he''s into it.  Nice detail (what brand underwear is that?).  I picked 5 10s and this is the best of those...</td>', 'This is my blue ribbon winner.  The lighting in the back is great; both miminal, but exciting.  The expression of the musician is not "ordinary"; he certainly looks like he''s into it.  Nice detail (what brand underwear is that?).  I picked 5 10s and this is the best of those...', '2005-08-17 12:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617975, 218612, 19672, '<td valign="top">intriguing soft focus, nice use of lighting, very artistic...would try using a digital paintbrush filter and selling as a print "The Guitarist Nude"</td>', 'intriguing soft focus, nice use of lighting, very artistic...would try using a digital paintbrush filter and selling as a print "The Guitarist Nude"', '2005-08-17 12:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617976, 218667, 19672, '<td valign="top">live music...not live noise....</td>', 'live music...not live noise....', '2005-08-17 12:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617982, 218841, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is top 3 in my voting (well, ok, I picked 5 10''s...so top 5).  But of those 5, I like this second best.  The leading lines are perfect.  The processing of the B&amp;W is excellent.  The isolation of the street performer is poignant.  Even the umbrella is a serendipitous touch.  I don''t think the border distracts.</td>', 'This is top 3 in my voting (well, ok, I picked 5 10''s...so top 5).  But of those 5, I like this second best.  The leading lines are perfect.  The processing of the B&W is excellent.  The isolation of the street performer is poignant.  Even the umbrella is a serendipitous touch.  I don''t think the border distracts.', '2005-08-17 12:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617985, 216557, 19672, '<td valign="top">Real dark...nice shadowing but loses distinguishment</td>', 'Real dark...nice shadowing but loses distinguishment', '2005-08-17 12:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617988, 219020, 19672, '<td valign="top">Would have converted to B&amp;W would have reduce the model''s skin tone fluctuations</td>', 'Would have converted to B&W would have reduce the model''s skin tone fluctuations', '2005-08-17 12:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617989, 217856, 40718, '<td valign="top">I picked 5 10''s, this is one of them.  It is classic in the "rock" elements: the guitarist without a shirt, the raised instrument, the "devil horns" sign.  I think this captures "live music" very well.  The image is low-key, but that works in a rock setting.</td>', 'I picked 5 10''s, this is one of them.  It is classic in the "rock" elements: the guitarist without a shirt, the raised instrument, the "devil horns" sign.  I think this captures "live music" very well.  The image is low-key, but that works in a rock setting.', '2005-08-17 12:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617992, 219008, 19672, '<td valign="top">nice but I''d like to see more towards the top and maybe to the left</td>', 'nice but I''d like to see more towards the top and maybe to the left', '2005-08-17 12:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1617997, 217801, 19672, '<td valign="top">Good expressing, good capture,  face is a tad dark compared to the body but hey....not bad at all...<br/> <br/>(dodging/burning could help this a lot - though i am aware such could not be used for this challenge)</td>', 'Good expressing, good capture,  face is a tad dark compared to the body but hey....not bad at all... (dodging/burning could help this a lot - though i am aware such could not be used for this challenge)', '2005-08-17 12:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618000, 216830, 40718, '<td valign="top">Great pic.  I''ll forgive the graininess because I''m sure it was dark when you shot it.  The light as highlight is nearly perfectly placed (sometimes better lucky than good).  I like the focus point being the mike, although some others might want it on his face.  I give it a 10.</td>', 'Great pic.  I''ll forgive the graininess because I''m sure it was dark when you shot it.  The light as highlight is nearly perfectly placed (sometimes better lucky than good).  I like the focus point being the mike, although some others might want it on his face.  I give it a 10.', '2005-08-17 12:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618002, 217556, 19672, '<td valign="top">What a great capture. I''d crop out the blue object on the left....<br/> <br/></td>', 'What a great capture. I''d crop out the blue object on the left.... ', '2005-08-17 12:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618006, 217443, 19672, '<td valign="top">Noisy distracting background....BUT superb ariel capture...<br/> <br/>:-)</td>', 'Noisy distracting background....BUT superb ariel capture... :-)', '2005-08-17 12:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618008, 218382, 40718, '<td valign="top">10.  The parallel between the spotlight and the bass guitar makes for excellent composition.  The background is minimal.  It is a bit over-contrasty, but I think that works in this setting.  Rock music, after all, is about the dramatic.</td>', '10.  The parallel between the spotlight and the bass guitar makes for excellent composition.  The background is minimal.  It is a bit over-contrasty, but I think that works in this setting.  Rock music, after all, is about the dramatic.', '2005-08-17 12:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618009, 218025, 19672, '<td valign="top">I know how hard these shots are...sadly the movement is very noticeable on the DJ....<br/> <br/>Good effort, nice inclusion of the dance floor though</td>', 'I know how hard these shots are...sadly the movement is very noticeable on the DJ.... Good effort, nice inclusion of the dance floor though', '2005-08-17 12:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618011, 218610, 39038, '<td valign="top">The DOF is too thin, a bit more would have made this photo very interesting. and the sharpness suffers even the front "singer"</td>', 'The DOF is too thin, a bit more would have made this photo very interesting. and the sharpness suffers even the front "singer"', '2005-08-17 12:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618012, 217591, 19672, '<td valign="top">Great shot, a bit over exposed though</td>', 'Great shot, a bit over exposed though', '2005-08-17 12:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618015, 217525, 19672, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow effect, I''d have almost darkened it more so as to make it just a shadow. Sky gives the effect of being on top of the world</td>', 'Nice shadow effect, I''d have almost darkened it more so as to make it just a shadow. Sky gives the effect of being on top of the world', '2005-08-17 12:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618016, 218370, 38925, '<td valign="top">nice colors, and good contrast</td>', 'nice colors, and good contrast', '2005-08-17 12:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618017, 216550, 19672, '<td valign="top">Goood expression, clear view of face....</td>', 'Goood expression, clear view of face....', '2005-08-17 12:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618026, 218851, 38925, '<td valign="top">sharp one, i really like it, amazing frame</td>', 'sharp one, i really like it, amazing frame', '2005-08-17 12:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618027, 218642, 40718, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  Like some other pics, a bit high on the contrast, but it works in the setting of rock.  I gave it a 9.</td>', 'Excellent composition.  Like some other pics, a bit high on the contrast, but it works in the setting of rock.  I gave it a 9.', '2005-08-17 12:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618030, 216960, 117, '<td valign="top">Maybe work on the color cast with ps to get the blues or purples out.</td>', 'Maybe work on the color cast with ps to get the blues or purples out.', '2005-08-17 12:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618031, 217274, 19672, '<td valign="top">Great capture...but you should have cropped it more. You could crop out hte distracting blue sign on the left and the head on the left. Along with the white sign on the right and the head on the right and maintained most of the the look and feel without distracting elements. Had you done this it''d be a likely 8.</td>', 'Great capture...but you should have cropped it more. You could crop out hte distracting blue sign on the left and the head on the left. Along with the white sign on the right and the head on the right and maintained most of the the look and feel without distracting elements. Had you done this it''d be a likely 8.', '2005-08-17 12:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618034, 217160, 38925, '<td valign="top">amazing frame, i really like it, really nice, good Expression</td>', 'amazing frame, i really like it, really nice, good Expression', '2005-08-17 12:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618035, 218641, 8522, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s an interesting studio shot but not much about it communicates ''live music'' to me.</td>', 'Well, it''s an interesting studio shot but not much about it communicates ''live music'' to me.', '2005-08-17 12:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618036, 218361, 38925, '<td valign="top">amazing frame, but i think it need a bit of more contrast and highlight</td>', 'amazing frame, but i think it need a bit of more contrast and highlight', '2005-08-17 12:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618038, 217149, 38925, '<td valign="top">nice frame and good lighting, good luck</td>', 'nice frame and good lighting, good luck', '2005-08-17 12:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618040, 217522, 19672, '<td valign="top">uh...weak association...</td>', 'uh...weak association...', '2005-08-17 12:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618041, 218972, 8522, '<td valign="top">OOF. Centred compositions don''t normally work for me, it strikes me as unimaginative here. Doesn''t really meet the spirit of a live music challenge IMO. Background is burnt out.</td>', 'OOF. Centred compositions don''t normally work for me, it strikes me as unimaginative here. Doesn''t really meet the spirit of a live music challenge IMO. Background is burnt out.', '2005-08-17 12:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618043, 218597, 19672, '<td valign="top">nice....good choice to cut it off above the hands if you''re going to cut a sax</td>', 'nice....good choice to cut it off above the hands if you''re going to cut a sax', '2005-08-17 12:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618044, 216608, 38925, '<td valign="top">nice frame, i really like it, but i think you need to sharpen the colors a bit</td>', 'nice frame, i really like it, but i think you need to sharpen the colors a bit', '2005-08-17 12:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618045, 218324, 38925, '<td valign="top">amazing frame, i really like it</td>', 'amazing frame, i really like it', '2005-08-17 12:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618048, 218584, 38925, '<td valign="top">this is nice i really like it</td>', 'this is nice i really like it', '2005-08-17 12:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618049, 216541, 8522, '<td valign="top">Live music? This isn''t a real instrument.</td>', 'Live music? This isn''t a real instrument.', '2005-08-17 12:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618051, 218328, 40718, '<td valign="top">The flowing hair gives action and life to the picture.  The tattoos are nice.  It''s too bad the blue light wasn''t in a slightly different position, looks like it''s growing out of her head. 9.</td>', 'The flowing hair gives action and life to the picture.  The tattoos are nice.  It''s too bad the blue light wasn''t in a slightly different position, looks like it''s growing out of her head. 9.', '2005-08-17 12:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618052, 218555, 35739, '<td valign="top">Cropping off alittle of the sky may have been nice.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Cropping off alittle of the sky may have been nice.  Nice capture.', '2005-08-17 12:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618053, 218960, 38925, '<td valign="top">amazing colors and amazing frame, really nice</td>', 'amazing colors and amazing frame, really nice', '2005-08-17 12:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618055, 218733, 19672, '<td valign="top">really grainy feel to the lights...odd effect...<br/> <br/>are these twins?</td>', 'really grainy feel to the lights...odd effect... are these twins?', '2005-08-17 12:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618059, 218341, 8522, '<td valign="top">Instead of arty grainy, this looks accidentally grainy. Burnt out patches on face don''t help. The bow goes straight across one of the eyes which is usually a composition no-no.</td>', 'Instead of arty grainy, this looks accidentally grainy. Burnt out patches on face don''t help. The bow goes straight across one of the eyes which is usually a composition no-no.', '2005-08-17 12:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618060, 217378, 38925, '<td valign="top">one of the best in this challenge, amzing frame, so my first 10, good luck</td>', 'one of the best in this challenge, amzing frame, so my first 10, good luck', '2005-08-17 12:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618061, 218903, 19672, '<td valign="top">good expression, a touch grainy (neat image could improve a bit)<br/> <br/>But good capture of expression</td>', 'good expression, a touch grainy (neat image could improve a bit) But good capture of expression', '2005-08-17 12:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618063, 218820, 35739, '<td valign="top">Too small of the image.  What I can see tells me the sky is too harsh.  Cannot tell if the image is in focus or not.</td>', 'Too small of the image.  What I can see tells me the sky is too harsh.  Cannot tell if the image is in focus or not.', '2005-08-17 12:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618064, 218802, 19672, '<td valign="top">fanciful</td>', 'fanciful', '2005-08-17 12:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618065, 218970, 39038, '<td valign="top">a bit soft to me. If it was sharper, you would have got an 8 from me.</td>', 'a bit soft to me. If it was sharper, you would have got an 8 from me.', '2005-08-17 12:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618066, 217604, 19672, '<td valign="top">interesting.....not sure how i feel on this...but intriguing none-the-less</td>', 'interesting.....not sure how i feel on this...but intriguing none-the-less', '2005-08-17 12:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618067, 218316, 19672, '<td valign="top">if it was a little brighter</td>', 'if it was a little brighter', '2005-08-17 12:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618068, 216769, 8522, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t choose to draw too much attention to these particular fingernails. Focus isn''t particularly sharp and the dof isn''t shallow enough to make this composition work. Too much glare/reflection off the guitar body. I don''t get much of a sense of this being ''live'', I think more context is needed.</td>', 'I wouldn''t choose to draw too much attention to these particular fingernails. Focus isn''t particularly sharp and the dof isn''t shallow enough to make this composition work. Too much glare/reflection off the guitar body. I don''t get much of a sense of this being ''live'', I think more context is needed.', '2005-08-17 12:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618074, 217392, 8522, '<td valign="top">Love his eyes. Shame about the light shirts in the background which distract the eye from the subject. The knuckle is just a tad too near the edge of the frame on the right hand side. Nice triangular composition though.</td>', 'Love his eyes. Shame about the light shirts in the background which distract the eye from the subject. The knuckle is just a tad too near the edge of the frame on the right hand side. Nice triangular composition though.', '2005-08-17 12:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618077, 217115, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of this almost but not quite centred composition. Hard to tell what the music was like from this shot, I don''t get much of a sense of being there, other than being far away from the action. It looks rather dull.</td>', 'Not a fan of this almost but not quite centred composition. Hard to tell what the music was like from this shot, I don''t get much of a sense of being there, other than being far away from the action. It looks rather dull.', '2005-08-17 12:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618079, 218970, 40718, '<td valign="top">Of the "closeup of the performer''s instrument" genre, I felt this was one of the best.  It''s slightly out of focus in the foreground, but I think the quality of the man''s hands make up for it.  The highlights on the clarinet(?) are done right too. 9.</td>', 'Of the "closeup of the performer''s instrument" genre, I felt this was one of the best.  It''s slightly out of focus in the foreground, but I think the quality of the man''s hands make up for it.  The highlights on the clarinet(?) are done right too. 9.', '2005-08-17 12:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618084, 218833, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nothing says "heavy metal" like spikes, makeup, and flailing hair.  Nice "live" feel.  I like the lighting in the back, but it''s a bummer the equipment is slightly distracting (especially that thing with the red cap.  Were this advanced editing, you could have taken care of it, so I won''t hold it against you...) 9.</td>', 'Nothing says "heavy metal" like spikes, makeup, and flailing hair.  Nice "live" feel.  I like the lighting in the back, but it''s a bummer the equipment is slightly distracting (especially that thing with the red cap.  Were this advanced editing, you could have taken care of it, so I won''t hold it against you...) 9.', '2005-08-17 12:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618085, 217432, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, triangular white shape behind foreground bagpipist leads the eye to this performer. Totally ruined by beater of the background drummer obsuring her eye/face. Not a fan of the blur which looks like it''s been added in PP.</td>', 'Interesting shot, triangular white shape behind foreground bagpipist leads the eye to this performer. Totally ruined by beater of the background drummer obsuring her eye/face. Not a fan of the blur which looks like it''s been added in PP.', '2005-08-17 12:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618092, 218903, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose and expression from foreground singer, spoilt by the fact that the guitarist''s face/head has been accidentally obscured. Nothing is sharp enough. Looks like it needs a curves adjustment to deepen the shadows.</td>', 'Interesting pose and expression from foreground singer, spoilt by the fact that the guitarist''s face/head has been accidentally obscured. Nothing is sharp enough. Looks like it needs a curves adjustment to deepen the shadows.', '2005-08-17 12:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618093, 217645, 37444, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but since the man is half in the photo, either take him out or include him a bit more. Still a 10 :)</td>', 'Nice capture, but since the man is half in the photo, either take him out or include him a bit more. Still a 10 :)', '2005-08-17 12:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618096, 218557, 40718, '<td valign="top">There were lots of "closeup of the instrument" pictures.  I felt this was the best.  The highlights of the metal are excellent, not too blown out (still some detail).  The background helps add contrrast, but isn''t totally black which would have made the picture feel less "live".  I even like the wedding ring which mirrors the trumpet tone (but of course you didn''t have much to do with that).  A 9.</td>', 'There were lots of "closeup of the instrument" pictures.  I felt this was the best.  The highlights of the metal are excellent, not too blown out (still some detail).  The background helps add contrrast, but isn''t totally black which would have made the picture feel less "live".  I even like the wedding ring which mirrors the trumpet tone (but of course you didn''t have much to do with that).  A 9.', '2005-08-17 12:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618098, 216426, 37444, '<td valign="top">Great moment, but the background could be better (not under your control, I know)- 10</td>', 'Great moment, but the background could be better (not under your control, I know)- 10', '2005-08-17 12:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618101, 218052, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very strange crop, eyes are way to near the edge of the frame and if you''re going to include the bell, include all of it! Sun is too harsh for an effective shot. Nice expression though.</td>', 'Very strange crop, eyes are way to near the edge of the frame and if you''re going to include the bell, include all of it! Sun is too harsh for an effective shot. Nice expression though.', '2005-08-17 12:46:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1618104, 216944, 19672, '<td valign="top">Great live capture...minor points... (hand blocking face) and dark skin not showing up as clearly but I imagine a little dodge &amp; burn outside of the challenge would do it wonders</td>', 'Great live capture...minor points... (hand blocking face) and dark skin not showing up as clearly but I imagine a little dodge & burn outside of the challenge would do it wonders', '2005-08-17 12:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618105, 217819, 40718, '<td valign="top">Two pics of the same performer.  I prefer this one.  Excellent composition and tonality.  Fine detail.  Even the shadowed hint at her breast adds to the "excitement" of the picture.  OK, now that I look at it again, her dress is a tiny bit overblown, but still a great shot.  Top 10.  I give it a 9.</td>', 'Two pics of the same performer.  I prefer this one.  Excellent composition and tonality.  Fine detail.  Even the shadowed hint at her breast adds to the "excitement" of the picture.  OK, now that I look at it again, her dress is a tiny bit overblown, but still a great shot.  Top 10.  I give it a 9.', '2005-08-17 12:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618106, 216762, 8522, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... after the brown?</td>', 'Hmmm... after the brown?', '2005-08-17 12:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618111, 218592, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not keen on his expression and damaged finger. Needs more of a sense of context and surroundings IMO.</td>', 'Not keen on his expression and damaged finger. Needs more of a sense of context and surroundings IMO.', '2005-08-17 12:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618113, 217681, 40718, '<td valign="top">The selective desaturation works well for this picture.  The anonimity of the performer also adds to the "dreaming" nature of the shot.  8.</td>', 'The selective desaturation works well for this picture.  The anonimity of the performer also adds to the "dreaming" nature of the shot.  8.', '2005-08-17 12:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618114, 218555, 19672, '<td valign="top">Tighter crop on the left to crop out dark blue artifact.  A tad shadowed...But an interesting capture</td>', 'Tighter crop on the left to crop out dark blue artifact.  A tad shadowed...But an interesting capture', '2005-08-17 12:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618115, 216769, 19672, '<td valign="top">Wow...talk about a yellow background...blinding</td>', 'Wow...talk about a yellow background...blinding', '2005-08-17 12:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618117, 218597, 40718, '<td valign="top">The sepia works with this picture.  Maybe just a tiny bit underexposed on his face.  I still like it a lot.  9.</td>', 'The sepia works with this picture.  Maybe just a tiny bit underexposed on his face.  I still like it a lot.  9.', '2005-08-17 12:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618119, 219055, 8522, '<td valign="top">Seems a little underexposed... at least raise the gamma. His sticks don''t look like they''re moving... how about a tripod and some motion blur with the performer staying still (apart from his hands) while the commuters pass by?</td>', 'Seems a little underexposed... at least raise the gamma. His sticks don''t look like they''re moving... how about a tripod and some motion blur with the performer staying still (apart from his hands) while the commuters pass by?', '2005-08-17 12:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618121, 218641, 38925, '<td valign="top">nice frame, i like it</td>', 'nice frame, i like it', '2005-08-17 12:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618122, 218665, 19672, '<td valign="top">Too small...not enough presence, the stage is the focus but near impossible to see, the people in the foreground are blurred but the only prominent objects</td>', 'Too small...not enough presence, the stage is the focus but near impossible to see, the people in the foreground are blurred but the only prominent objects', '2005-08-17 12:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618124, 216762, 19672, '<td valign="top">pushing it with this one, and sadly the head is blurred</td>', 'pushing it with this one, and sadly the head is blurred', '2005-08-17 12:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618125, 218815, 38925, '<td valign="top">nice frame, i really like it, nice one, good luck</td>', 'nice frame, i really like it, nice one, good luck', '2005-08-17 12:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618126, 218970, 19672, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of old wrinkle hands. Would have liked to se the top of the wind piece</td>', 'Nice capture of old wrinkle hands. Would have liked to se the top of the wind piece', '2005-08-17 12:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618127, 218851, 19672, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness and clarity...like a spider dancing on the keys</td>', 'Nice sharpness and clarity...like a spider dancing on the keys', '2005-08-17 12:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618129, 218411, 9690, '<td valign="top">Too bad he split his pants!  Is that tape in his crotch? :))</td>', 'Too bad he split his pants!  Is that tape in his crotch? :))', '2005-08-17 12:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618131, 217240, 19672, '<td valign="top">fun, lively, but focus seems more children with live music in the background</td>', 'fun, lively, but focus seems more children with live music in the background', '2005-08-17 12:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618133, 217753, 40718, '<td valign="top">It''s tough when you submit a picture where someone else has photographed the same subject.  Head to head comparisons are inevitable and the other picture is superior.  I do like the green lighting in the back of this one.  Her shirt is blown out a bit.  The two foot long cigar is certainly outrageous enough to make for an interesting "rock" picture. 7.</td>', 'It''s tough when you submit a picture where someone else has photographed the same subject.  Head to head comparisons are inevitable and the other picture is superior.  I do like the green lighting in the back of this one.  Her shirt is blown out a bit.  The two foot long cigar is certainly outrageous enough to make for an interesting "rock" picture. 7.', '2005-08-17 12:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618134, 216550, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sharp enough, and the composition just doesn''t do a lot for me. I would have zoomed closer, leaving plenty of negative space to the left (as he''s looking that way). A little overexposed.</td>', 'Not sharp enough, and the composition just doesn''t do a lot for me. I would have zoomed closer, leaving plenty of negative space to the left (as he''s looking that way). A little overexposed.', '2005-08-17 12:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618135, 218798, 35739, '<td valign="top">Appears to be overexposed.</td>', 'Appears to be overexposed.', '2005-08-17 12:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618136, 218841, 38925, '<td valign="top">amazing frame and nice Composition, i really like it</td>', 'amazing frame and nice Composition, i really like it', '2005-08-17 12:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618138, 216643, 38925, '<td valign="top">nice colors, i like it</td>', 'nice colors, i like it', '2005-08-17 12:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618144, 218411, 40718, '<td valign="top">A nice "rock" picture.  Alice is an icon, of course.  I''m not too thrilled how his crotch seems to be so prominent.  The belt buckle saves it, but still the angle is a little too severe.  8.</td>', 'A nice "rock" picture.  Alice is an icon, of course.  I''m not too thrilled how his crotch seems to be so prominent.  The belt buckle saves it, but still the angle is a little too severe.  8.', '2005-08-17 12:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618145, 217149, 8522, '<td valign="top">Background is a tad too cluttered, I''d have reduced the dof by backing away and increasing the zoom, or opening the aperture. His expression doesn''t really do a lot for me here. Elbow is cropped just a tad too much for my taste. Not really a fan of the green tones.</td>', 'Background is a tad too cluttered, I''d have reduced the dof by backing away and increasing the zoom, or opening the aperture. His expression doesn''t really do a lot for me here. Elbow is cropped just a tad too much for my taste. Not really a fan of the green tones.', '2005-08-17 12:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618146, 219055, 19672, '<td valign="top">a little dark and a little out of focus..good composition for the most part, but crop out the arm on the left</td>', 'a little dark and a little out of focus..good composition for the most part, but crop out the arm on the left', '2005-08-17 12:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618147, 219011, 9690, '<td valign="top">I like the effect, but I''m not so sure how crazy I am about the lighting on the trumpet.  It must be a challenge, however, lighting something that is so reflective.  Something else that bothers me is how the hand is holding the trumpet.  It isn''t held that way when someone is playing, so it gives the image that a person is just holding it up in the air.</td>', 'I like the effect, but I''m not so sure how crazy I am about the lighting on the trumpet.  It must be a challenge, however, lighting something that is so reflective.  Something else that bothers me is how the hand is holding the trumpet.  It isn''t held that way when someone is playing, so it gives the image that a person is just holding it up in the air.', '2005-08-17 12:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618149, 218213, 40718, '<td valign="top">The green fog makes this picture rate higher than I otherwise would have rated it.  Excellent contrast with the pink.  Such clashy colors work for "rock".  The performer seems to be a little under exposed.  7.</td>', 'The green fog makes this picture rate higher than I otherwise would have rated it.  Excellent contrast with the pink.  Such clashy colors work for "rock".  The performer seems to be a little under exposed.  7.', '2005-08-17 12:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618150, 218667, 9690, '<td valign="top">Definately does not fit the challenge...  Bad use of a PF reference.</td>', 'Definately does not fit the challenge...  Bad use of a PF reference.', '2005-08-17 12:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618151, 218382, 19672, '<td valign="top">Superb shot, great lighting, good capture of the face, the shadow is artistic but key elements well lit...<br/> <br/>(9) and the highest score from me yet</td>', 'Superb shot, great lighting, good capture of the face, the shadow is artistic but key elements well lit... (9) and the highest score from me yet', '2005-08-17 12:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618154, 218815, 9690, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Very unique.</td>', 'I like this.  Very unique.', '2005-08-17 12:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618157, 216940, 8522, '<td valign="top">Seeing as he''s at the microphone, I''d have grabbed him with his mouth open and waited for them to get a bit more into it, they look a bit static here which is not what this kind of music is about. I''d also have tried to get a bit lower so the microphone was less close to the eyes of the performer at the back.</td>', 'Seeing as he''s at the microphone, I''d have grabbed him with his mouth open and waited for them to get a bit more into it, they look a bit static here which is not what this kind of music is about. I''d also have tried to get a bit lower so the microphone was less close to the eyes of the performer at the back.', '2005-08-17 12:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618158, 217378, 19672, '<td valign="top">Hmm...would have like to see this reversed, the focus on the love birds and the fiddler blurred.  I think the crop on the left may be too much...</td>', 'Hmm...would have like to see this reversed, the focus on the love birds and the fiddler blurred.  I think the crop on the left may be too much...', '2005-08-17 12:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618159, 218324, 9690, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I like the haggard look.  This may have actually been better B&amp;W.</td>', 'Good shot.  I like the haggard look.  This may have actually been better B&W.', '2005-08-17 12:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618161, 216608, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to be both strict about the interpretation of the challenge and open minded.  Of all pictures where music is not actually being played, this rates the highest.  The colors are beautiful and I love the grace of her hand holding the bow.  It''s too bad the hanging guitar slightly distracts.  8.</td>', 'I''m trying to be both strict about the interpretation of the challenge and open minded.  Of all pictures where music is not actually being played, this rates the highest.  The colors are beautiful and I love the grace of her hand holding the bow.  It''s too bad the hanging guitar slightly distracts.  8.', '2005-08-17 12:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618162, 218316, 37444, '<td valign="top">Superb capture; would have liked a bit more distinction between his facial outline and the background. Still a 10.</td>', 'Superb capture; would have liked a bit more distinction between his facial outline and the background. Still a 10.', '2005-08-17 12:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618164, 217369, 9690, '<td valign="top">NNot a great shot.  Need to work on lighting and depth of field.  The edges of your background pic are showing as well.</td>', 'NNot a great shot.  Need to work on lighting and depth of field.  The edges of your background pic are showing as well.', '2005-08-17 12:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618165, 218218, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, spoilt by the line in the background which bisects his head. I''d also have gone in much tighter, why do you need his legs? Composition seems unimaginative. What''s that at the bottom right of the shot, couldn''t it be cropped out?</td>', 'Interesting effect, spoilt by the line in the background which bisects his head. I''d also have gone in much tighter, why do you need his legs? Composition seems unimaginative. What''s that at the bottom right of the shot, couldn''t it be cropped out?', '2005-08-17 12:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618166, 217511, 9690, '<td valign="top">Good pic.  Good capture of emotion.</td>', 'Good pic.  Good capture of emotion.', '2005-08-17 12:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618167, 218451, 37444, '<td valign="top">Indeed it is :) I would have left the shutter open a bit more to smooth the water, or stop action completely. 10</td>', 'Indeed it is :) I would have left the shutter open a bit more to smooth the water, or stop action completely. 10', '2005-08-17 12:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618169, 219011, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, but certainly doesn''t say ''live music'' to me. Trumpet needs a little more light.</td>', 'Interesting effect, but certainly doesn''t say ''live music'' to me. Trumpet needs a little more light.', '2005-08-17 12:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618170, 217170, 40718, '<td valign="top">We knew there were going to be "street performer" pictures.  This one is second best in my mind.  I love the addition of the two spectators watching as they walk by hand-in-hand.  The tonality and contrast are done well.  8.</td>', 'We knew there were going to be "street performer" pictures.  This one is second best in my mind.  I love the addition of the two spectators watching as they walk by hand-in-hand.  The tonality and contrast are done well.  8.', '2005-08-17 12:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618171, 218842, 9690, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but Im not sure I like the angle.  I like the story the pic is telling, but I think a better composition could have added some zing.</td>', 'Good shot, but Im not sure I like the angle.  I like the story the pic is telling, but I think a better composition could have added some zing.', '2005-08-17 12:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618173, 218833, 37444, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture. Background is wonderful, super action. The blownout sky is no biggie - 10.</td>', 'Fantastic capture. Background is wonderful, super action. The blownout sky is no biggie - 10.', '2005-08-17 12:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618175, 218535, 9690, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  I like the motion that is captured.  Not so sure about the KEYTAR, but I like the motion. :))</td>', 'I like this shot.  I like the motion that is captured.  Not so sure about the KEYTAR, but I like the motion. :))', '2005-08-17 12:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618176, 217378, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea, but the romantic intentions are spoilt by the harsh light. Converting to b&amp;w could have been very effective. I like the composition.</td>', 'Lovely idea, but the romantic intentions are spoilt by the harsh light. Converting to b&w could have been very effective. I like the composition.', '2005-08-17 12:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618177, 218063, 9690, '<td valign="top">Focus is off.</td>', 'Focus is off.', '2005-08-17 12:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618178, 217967, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the attempt at this one.  The setting is dramatic.  The subject is a little overblown (in his banjo and the lighting on his hand).  The hat is a nice touch.  I like it enough to overlook those technical faults. 8.</td>', 'I like the attempt at this one.  The setting is dramatic.  The subject is a little overblown (in his banjo and the lighting on his hand).  The hat is a nice touch.  I like it enough to overlook those technical faults. 8.', '2005-08-17 12:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618179, 218411, 37444, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but it begs the question: where were you to get this angle? LOL - 10</td>', 'Great shot, but it begs the question: where were you to get this angle? LOL - 10', '2005-08-17 12:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618180, 218882, 9690, '<td valign="top">This is a very "pretty" shot.  Nice lighting, nice DOF.</td>', 'This is a very "pretty" shot.  Nice lighting, nice DOF.', '2005-08-17 12:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618181, 217556, 9690, '<td valign="top">Scary, but cute</td>', 'Scary, but cute', '2005-08-17 13:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618182, 217392, 40718, '<td valign="top">Great tonality.  I like the concentration of his face.  8.</td>', 'Great tonality.  I like the concentration of his face.  8.', '2005-08-17 13:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618183, 218852, 37444, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. I''d like a bit more contrast in the lower part of the image, but still a 10!</td>', 'Fantastic shot. I''d like a bit more contrast in the lower part of the image, but still a 10!', '2005-08-17 13:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618184, 217522, 9690, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... just doesnt meet the challenge enough for me.</td>', 'Hmmm... just doesnt meet the challenge enough for me.', '2005-08-17 13:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618186, 216805, 8522, '<td valign="top">Superb idea, I love the reflection. I think it''s too closely cropped though, at least include the end of the microphone. More dof needed, one of the main focal points is the pierced lip which needs to be in focus. 2x3 ratio would have worked much better here.</td>', 'Superb idea, I love the reflection. I think it''s too closely cropped though, at least include the end of the microphone. More dof needed, one of the main focal points is the pierced lip which needs to be in focus. 2x3 ratio would have worked much better here.', '2005-08-17 13:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618189, 217170, 37444, '<td valign="top">I love this shot and the story it tells. 10</td>', 'I love this shot and the story it tells. 10', '2005-08-17 13:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618190, 218552, 9690, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot.  I really like the lighting.  I like the overall softness of it as well.  One of my favs so far.</td>', 'Very cute shot.  I really like the lighting.  I like the overall softness of it as well.  One of my favs so far.', '2005-08-17 13:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618194, 218976, 8522, '<td valign="top">If only the drum was in focus. I like the blurred hands. Background above the drum needs to be plain and uncluttered. Not quite clear enough.</td>', 'If only the drum was in focus. I like the blurred hands. Background above the drum needs to be plain and uncluttered. Not quite clear enough.', '2005-08-17 13:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618196, 216946, 37444, '<td valign="top">Wonmderful subject, but the upper left corner is distracting and the man''s sleeve being OOF is also a bit distracting. Still a 10.</td>', 'Wonmderful subject, but the upper left corner is distracting and the man''s sleeve being OOF is also a bit distracting. Still a 10.', '2005-08-17 13:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618197, 218867, 9690, '<td valign="top">Boy, this really has a very early 80s quality to it.  This may have been good for the time capsule challenge as well.  Great job!  (trim the nose hair :)) )</td>', 'Boy, this really has a very early 80s quality to it.  This may have been good for the time capsule challenge as well.  Great job!  (trim the nose hair :)) )', '2005-08-17 13:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618201, 218970, 37444, '<td valign="top">Waht can I say - superb! I''d love to see another shot of this man''s face! 10</td>', 'Waht can I say - superb! I''d love to see another shot of this man''s face! 10', '2005-08-17 13:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618202, 218361, 9690, '<td valign="top">Somehow, this looks staged.  It may not have been,  but it just looks that way.  It comes off a little flat.</td>', 'Somehow, this looks staged.  It may not have been,  but it just looks that way.  It comes off a little flat.', '2005-08-17 13:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
