(1618349, 218328, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great tatoos and hair. But WHY include half a hand? If you''re going to have a hand, have the WHOLE hand. Also, I''d have placed her nearer the right edge of the frame, otherwise the composition feels unbalanced and unimaginative.</td>', 'Great tatoos and hair. But WHY include half a hand? If you''re going to have a hand, have the WHOLE hand. Also, I''d have placed her nearer the right edge of the frame, otherwise the composition feels unbalanced and unimaginative.', '2005-08-17 13:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
