(1618358, 219057, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  This would have been better I think if you used a shallower depth of field so all the stuff in the background was distracting.</td>', 'I like the idea.  This would have been better I think if you used a shallower depth of field so all the stuff in the background was distracting.', '2005-08-17 13:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
