(1618362, 217508, 8522, '<td valign="top">Effective portrait, but doesn''t say ''Live Music'' to me. It looks too posed. Eyes aren''t in focus, which is the first place that needs it.</td>', 'Effective portrait, but doesn''t say ''Live Music'' to me. It looks too posed. Eyes aren''t in focus, which is the first place that needs it.', '2005-08-17 13:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
