(1618382, 218107, 8522, '<td valign="top">Love the wideangle, but I''d have laid down on the floor and got him from nearer his feet. I have nothing against grain, but I''m not so keen on the quality of it here which doesn''t feel like film grain. Surely this guy wouldn''t have minded some flash? If you have stuff with words on in the background, make sure you include the whole word. Not convinced by half a bass player at the edge of your shot.</td>', 'Love the wideangle, but I''d have laid down on the floor and got him from nearer his feet. I have nothing against grain, but I''m not so keen on the quality of it here which doesn''t feel like film grain. Surely this guy wouldn''t have minded some flash? If you have stuff with words on in the background, make sure you include the whole word. Not convinced by half a bass player at the edge of your shot.', '2005-08-17 13:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
