(1618459, 218891, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is totally hilarious!   What  genius composition!   5 stars to the models too!    Most definitely the most fun picture in the challenge!  Great job!</td>', 'This is totally hilarious!   What  genius composition!   5 stars to the models too!    Most definitely the most fun picture in the challenge!  Great job!', '2005-08-17 14:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618460, 217615, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, it took me a while to notice the audience member in the corner. I''d have tried to make more of the audience, as it''s not everyday that I see performers in the street. The performer seems a bit introverted here, I wonder if there were many moments where he connected with his audience more.</td>', 'Interesting composition, it took me a while to notice the audience member in the corner. I''d have tried to make more of the audience, as it''s not everyday that I see performers in the street. The performer seems a bit introverted here, I wonder if there were many moments where he connected with his audience more.', '2005-08-17 14:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618463, 217665, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect of the lights, the hugeness of the stage, and how crisp and sharp everything is.   I love it.</td>', 'Very cool effect of the lights, the hugeness of the stage, and how crisp and sharp everything is.   I love it.', '2005-08-17 14:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618464, 217160, 8522, '<td valign="top">I like the backlighting, which highlights the sweat nicely. Shame the face isn''t sharper, it''s just a little OOF.</td>', 'I like the backlighting, which highlights the sweat nicely. Shame the face isn''t sharper, it''s just a little OOF.', '2005-08-17 14:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618465, 218886, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, too bad all the electrical wires clutter up the picture.</td>', 'Nice idea, too bad all the electrical wires clutter up the picture.', '2005-08-17 14:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618468, 217762, 24454, '<td valign="top">How talented she must be!   Great capture!</td>', 'How talented she must be!   Great capture!', '2005-08-17 14:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618471, 218891, 24413, '<td valign="top">Funny!</td>', 'Funny!', '2005-08-17 14:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618472, 218907, 8522, '<td valign="top">Clever title. Not a fan of the green tones or quality of grain here though. Background is too cluttered and takes away from the composition. Nice motion blur, but I would like to have seen more sharpness somewhere in the pic.</td>', 'Clever title. Not a fan of the green tones or quality of grain here though. Background is too cluttered and takes away from the composition. Nice motion blur, but I would like to have seen more sharpness somewhere in the pic.', '2005-08-17 14:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618475, 217525, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this!   It''s a perfect silhouette against such a beautiful blue sky!</td>', 'I love this!   It''s a perfect silhouette against such a beautiful blue sky!', '2005-08-17 14:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618476, 217652, 19672, '<td valign="top">great emotional piece the shadowed eyes work here because of the homeless conontations</td>', 'great emotional piece the shadowed eyes work here because of the homeless conontations', '2005-08-17 14:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618477, 216842, 24454, '<td valign="top">VERY awesome!  One of my favorites in this challenge!</td>', 'VERY awesome!  One of my favorites in this challenge!', '2005-08-17 14:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618478, 218800, 19672, '<td valign="top">sky...where did it go?</td>', 'sky...where did it go?', '2005-08-17 14:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618480, 218213, 19672, '<td valign="top">cute, sexy, great colors, a little dark on face, and little noisy/blurry (7)</td>', 'cute, sexy, great colors, a little dark on face, and little noisy/blurry (7)', '2005-08-17 14:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618481, 218517, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great composition, love the piano in the background. Grain works well. Dof is spot on, just covering the text. Camera angle works well. White balance is a little on the yellow side for my taste. One of my favourites so far.</td>', 'Great composition, love the piano in the background. Grain works well. Dof is spot on, just covering the text. Camera angle works well. White balance is a little on the yellow side for my taste. One of my favourites so far.', '2005-08-17 14:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618485, 217009, 24454, '<td valign="top">There''s just something about this picture that draws me in.   I really like it.  I think it does such a good job of saying "cameraderie" or something.   I love the setting.   Great job!</td>', 'There''s just something about this picture that draws me in.   I really like it.  I think it does such a good job of saying "cameraderie" or something.   I love the setting.   Great job!', '2005-08-17 14:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618486, 216608, 19672, '<td valign="top">great colors beautiful instrument...just beautiful....even if a bit abstract</td>', 'great colors beautiful instrument...just beautiful....even if a bit abstract', '2005-08-17 14:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618488, 216618, 19672, '<td valign="top">nice, might rotate for a more properly aligned photo</td>', 'nice, might rotate for a more properly aligned photo', '2005-08-17 14:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618490, 217556, 24454, '<td valign="top">Well, there certainly won''t be another one quite like this, will there?   :)   Very creative.   The expression on his face while he plays is priceless!</td>', 'Well, there certainly won''t be another one quite like this, will there?   :)   Very creative.   The expression on his face while he plays is priceless!', '2005-08-17 14:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618491, 218867, 19672, '<td valign="top">with a face only a mother could love....good shot....must be a really wide angle...look how small his ears are</td>', 'with a face only a mother could love....good shot....must be a really wide angle...look how small his ears are', '2005-08-17 14:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618492, 217368, 19672, '<td valign="top">I think this would benefit from zooming our a bit, also over-exposed on the bottom right</td>', 'I think this would benefit from zooming our a bit, also over-exposed on the bottom right', '2005-08-17 14:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618494, 217464, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the picture in spite of the huge border.</td>', 'I like the picture in spite of the huge border.', '2005-08-17 14:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618495, 218490, 19672, '<td valign="top">wow, great passionate energized moment (and for a pianist)...a bit provactive to boot.  A little sharper focus on face and a touch more distinguishment on piano would be a plus</td>', 'wow, great passionate energized moment (and for a pianist)...a bit provactive to boot.  A little sharper focus on face and a touch more distinguishment on piano would be a plus', '2005-08-17 14:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618496, 217753, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very well done!   That''s a real cigar, isn''t it!!!!   Wow!   I like your angle too!</td>', 'Very well done!   That''s a real cigar, isn''t it!!!!   Wow!   I like your angle too!', '2005-08-17 14:11:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1618498, 217705, 19672, '<td valign="top">um....it''s just not quite working for me, it''s okay but aside from blurry movement, etc it just isn''t quite capturing me fully</td>', 'um....it''s just not quite working for me, it''s okay but aside from blurry movement, etc it just isn''t quite capturing me fully', '2005-08-17 14:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618499, 218833, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks like quite a character. Good exposure, colour balance is good, a competent shot. Does strike me as a little unimaginative though, most decent photographers would have got a similar shot from the pit here. Did you take a stepladder? If not, this could have helped you get his feet and avoid including the edge of the stage.</td>', 'Looks like quite a character. Good exposure, colour balance is good, a competent shot. Does strike me as a little unimaginative though, most decent photographers would have got a similar shot from the pit here. Did you take a stepladder? If not, this could have helped you get his feet and avoid including the edge of the stage.', '2005-08-17 14:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618500, 219040, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwww. .. reminds me of my mom at the piano!  Very emotive for me!  Great job!</td>', 'Awwwww. .. reminds me of my mom at the piano!  Very emotive for me!  Great job!', '2005-08-17 14:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618503, 218584, 32378, '<td valign="top">Needs  different anglel to keep everything from growing out of his head the horizon is also a little distracting.</td>', 'Needs  different anglel to keep everything from growing out of his head the horizon is also a little distracting.', '2005-08-17 14:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618504, 216805, 4477, '<td valign="top">The reflection in the glasses makes this photo.</td>', 'The reflection in the glasses makes this photo.', '2005-08-17 14:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618506, 219110, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very well done!    Colors and skin tones are outstanding!</td>', 'Very well done!    Colors and skin tones are outstanding!', '2005-08-17 14:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618507, 217652, 8522, '<td valign="top">I like the musician in the foreground, but I''d have used curves to avoid his panda eyes. The chap in the background looks like he has a spike growing out of his head. Dof works well here.</td>', 'I like the musician in the foreground, but I''d have used curves to avoid his panda eyes. The chap in the background looks like he has a spike growing out of his head. Dof works well here.', '2005-08-17 14:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618508, 217480, 24454, '<td valign="top">I can almost hear him  :)    Great job!</td>', 'I can almost hear him  :)    Great job!', '2005-08-17 14:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618509, 219066, 34255, '<td valign="top">brilliant. best I''ve seen so far in this challenge.</td>', 'brilliant. best I''ve seen so far in this challenge.', '2005-08-17 14:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618512, 217256, 24454, '<td valign="top">Uh-oh. . . I bet you are hearing this alot, but I can''t see any connection to music.   It''s an incredible photo that I absolutely love!   BUT  it''s really hard to see it in a Live Music challenge.</td>', 'Uh-oh. . . I bet you are hearing this alot, but I can''t see any connection to music.   It''s an incredible photo that I absolutely love!   BUT  it''s really hard to see it in a Live Music challenge.', '2005-08-17 14:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618513, 217762, 8522, '<td valign="top">Onboard flash has not worked well here (in fact, doesn''t really work well anywhere). Quality of the light is too harsh, and casts unattractive shadows. I''m not at all sure about her expression. Background looks like not much thought went into it.</td>', 'Onboard flash has not worked well here (in fact, doesn''t really work well anywhere). Quality of the light is too harsh, and casts unattractive shadows. I''m not at all sure about her expression. Background looks like not much thought went into it.', '2005-08-17 14:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618515, 216944, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love the mood of this.   The lighting, the dark background.  The interaction.   I think it''s great.</td>', 'I love the mood of this.   The lighting, the dark background.  The interaction.   I think it''s great.', '2005-08-17 14:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618518, 217943, 4477, '<td valign="top">Yikes!</td>', 'Yikes!', '2005-08-17 14:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618519, 219044, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t convey live music to me.</td>', 'Doesn''t convey live music to me.', '2005-08-17 14:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618520, 218851, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice clean and simple.  I like it alot.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Nice clean and simple.  I like it alot.  Good Luck.', '2005-08-17 14:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618521, 218820, 40371, '<td valign="top">Would have been better if it was bigger.</td>', 'Would have been better if it was bigger.', '2005-08-17 14:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618522, 218970, 4477, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and composition... 8</td>', 'Love the lighting and composition... 8', '2005-08-17 14:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618523, 218151, 40371, '<td valign="top">The color in this is amazing!</td>', 'The color in this is amazing!', '2005-08-17 14:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618525, 218882, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''d love to photograph an opera. Shame the performer in the background is so tight against the performer in the foreground, I''d have stepped to the left to seperate them. Not a fan of distracting borders. Lovely catchlights.</td>', 'Wow, I''d love to photograph an opera. Shame the performer in the background is so tight against the performer in the foreground, I''d have stepped to the left to seperate them. Not a fan of distracting borders. Lovely catchlights.', '2005-08-17 14:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618526, 218451, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, don''t think it met the challeng, which I''m sure you will be told numerous times.</td>', 'Nice picture, don''t think it met the challeng, which I''m sure you will be told numerous times.', '2005-08-17 14:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618528, 218382, 40371, '<td valign="top">Great angle.  The smoke under the light is the perfect finishing touch.</td>', 'Great angle.  The smoke under the light is the perfect finishing touch.', '2005-08-17 14:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618529, 218025, 38592, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad to see a DJ make it into this challenge.  This was my idea aslo, but didn''t manage to get a pic.  I hope people realize that this IS live music also and don;t vote it down.</td>', 'I''m so glad to see a DJ make it into this challenge.  This was my idea aslo, but didn''t manage to get a pic.  I hope people realize that this IS live music also and don;t vote it down.', '2005-08-17 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618530, 219066, 8522, '<td valign="top">LOL, I really did laugh out loud as I saw this, it''s so cheesy. Despite the slightly too magenta/blue white balance I really like this shot, but it''s a shame nothing is quite sharp enough. Great idea.</td>', 'LOL, I really did laugh out loud as I saw this, it''s so cheesy. Despite the slightly too magenta/blue white balance I really like this shot, but it''s a shame nothing is quite sharp enough. Great idea.', '2005-08-17 14:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618532, 218597, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice mood shot, not quite sharp enough for my taste though. I like the figure on the left. I can''t help missing his hands, although you would have to change your composition drastically to include them.</td>', 'Nice mood shot, not quite sharp enough for my taste though. I like the figure on the left. I can''t help missing his hands, although you would have to change your composition drastically to include them.', '2005-08-17 14:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618534, 218557, 8522, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, which should place highly. Great composition, and his hands are quite expressive here.</td>', 'Love this shot, which should place highly. Great composition, and his hands are quite expressive here.', '2005-08-17 14:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618535, 217967, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very good job.  Tough lighting with all the contrast.</td>', 'Very good job.  Tough lighting with all the contrast.', '2005-08-17 14:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618536, 217426, 38592, '<td valign="top">Most people are probably going to vote you down for the use of this filter, but I actually think that it works well with this picture.  "8" from me for trying different things.</td>', 'Most people are probably going to vote you down for the use of this filter, but I actually think that it works well with this picture.  "8" from me for trying different things.', '2005-08-17 14:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618537, 218490, 40371, '<td valign="top">You lucky dog, getting to see Tori in concert is a real treat.</td>', 'You lucky dog, getting to see Tori in concert is a real treat.', '2005-08-17 14:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618538, 218866, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not usually a good idea to chop hands in half when photographing musicians. A square crop discarding the entire right portion of your shot would be much stronger, and would highlight the emotive nature of this performance.</td>', 'Not usually a good idea to chop hands in half when photographing musicians. A square crop discarding the entire right portion of your shot would be much stronger, and would highlight the emotive nature of this performance.', '2005-08-17 14:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618539, 217256, 38592, '<td valign="top">Does not meet challenge...... at all!</td>', 'Does not meet challenge...... at all!', '2005-08-17 14:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618543, 216842, 19672, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and nice  composition, good shadows and colors</td>', 'Good lighting and nice  composition, good shadows and colors', '2005-08-17 14:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618544, 218891, 19672, '<td valign="top">Disturbing....humorous....disturbing....goood composition...disturbing</td>', 'Disturbing....humorous....disturbing....goood composition...disturbing', '2005-08-17 14:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618545, 218641, 19672, '<td valign="top">It''s a bass, and a fair photo of one - but not too inspiring - to be honest</td>', 'It''s a bass, and a fair photo of one - but not too inspiring - to be honest', '2005-08-17 14:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618546, 217425, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great expression, but let down by the fact that I can''t see his right hand. Being a violinist, you should wait until the end of the upbow, when his right hand will appear just under his chin. The violin neck obscuring the eyes/face of the performer behind is also a no-no. I love the expression on the face of the woman to the left of the shot, I''d have made more of this.</td>', 'Great expression, but let down by the fact that I can''t see his right hand. Being a violinist, you should wait until the end of the upbow, when his right hand will appear just under his chin. The violin neck obscuring the eyes/face of the performer behind is also a no-no. I love the expression on the face of the woman to the left of the shot, I''d have made more of this.', '2005-08-17 14:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618548, 217525, 40371, '<td valign="top">The sky behind the performer is a spectacular addition.</td>', 'The sky behind the performer is a spectacular addition.', '2005-08-17 14:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618552, 217522, 25655, '<td valign="top">Ok, let me tell you something:<br/>Under any other normal conditions, I would probably vote a 6 on this image, and go on voting.<br/>It''s a really nice photo, just not the "wow" kind.<br/>The hot area on the right is too distracting, something in the background gives a busy feeling to this, and I can not concentrate on the water properly. <br/>Above average photo, but not much more then that.<br/>However, under this specific challenge, I think you have chosen a beautiful shot.<br/>It is out of the box, it is creative and thoughtful.<br/>Personally, I appreciate those qualities in a photo a lot more then perfect technicalities.<br/>and I hear the music.<br/> <br/>For that - I vote a 10 on this one.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge. I have a strange feeling that we are going to end this challenge side by side ;-)</td>', 'Ok, let me tell you something:Under any other normal conditions, I would probably vote a 6 on this image, and go on voting.It''s a really nice photo, just not the "wow" kind.The hot area on the right is too distracting, something in the background gives a busy feeling to this, and I can not concentrate on the water properly. Above average photo, but not much more then that.However, under this specific challenge, I think you have chosen a beautiful shot.It is out of the box, it is creative and thoughtful.Personally, I appreciate those qualities in a photo a lot more then perfect technicalities.and I hear the music. For that - I vote a 10 on this one. Good luck in the challenge. I have a strange feeling that we are going to end this challenge side by side ;-)', '2005-08-17 14:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618554, 218733, 36850, '<td valign="top">There''s too much extra space at the top of the photo</td>', 'There''s too much extra space at the top of the photo', '2005-08-17 14:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618555, 216797, 8522, '<td valign="top">What a great opportunity, but the composition just doesn''t work for me here. You''ve chopped her feet off! Did it not work well in colour? What about a portrait orientated shot with the drums at the edge of the frame, with loads of sky?</td>', 'What a great opportunity, but the composition just doesn''t work for me here. You''ve chopped her feet off! Did it not work well in colour? What about a portrait orientated shot with the drums at the edge of the frame, with loads of sky?', '2005-08-17 14:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618557, 219044, 40371, '<td valign="top">Cute concept, original for sure.</td>', 'Cute concept, original for sure.', '2005-08-17 14:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618558, 218842, 8522, '<td valign="top">The fact that he''s centred in the shot makes this feel like a snapshot. What about rule of thirds? Someone taking a photo behind him really lets this down. I''m not really sure what you were trying to achieve here.</td>', 'The fact that he''s centred in the shot makes this feel like a snapshot. What about rule of thirds? Someone taking a photo behind him really lets this down. I''m not really sure what you were trying to achieve here.', '2005-08-17 14:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618561, 218852, 8522, '<td valign="top">I like the motion blur on his left hand. Not a fan of the centred composition. Nothing''s quite sharp enough, and it could have done with some curves adjusments in PS.</td>', 'I like the motion blur on his left hand. Not a fan of the centred composition. Nothing''s quite sharp enough, and it could have done with some curves adjusments in PS.', '2005-08-17 14:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618564, 218974, 8522, '<td valign="top">OOF, badly lit, not straight, distortion from using a wide angle and doesn''t really communicate live music to me.</td>', 'OOF, badly lit, not straight, distortion from using a wide angle and doesn''t really communicate live music to me.', '2005-08-17 14:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618566, 217426, 19672, '<td valign="top">Good composition, intriguing use of filter....<br/> <br/>Sadly, I believe this is a basic challenge and said filter use will likely DQ the photo.  Although perhaps you utilized various global filters and color adjustments.</td>', 'Good composition, intriguing use of filter.... Sadly, I believe this is a basic challenge and said filter use will likely DQ the photo.  Although perhaps you utilized various global filters and color adjustments.', '2005-08-17 14:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618567, 216714, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t communicate live music to me, just a photo of a bass against a not particularly appealing background.</td>', 'Doesn''t communicate live music to me, just a photo of a bass against a not particularly appealing background.', '2005-08-17 14:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618570, 218909, 19672, '<td valign="top">good energy, but the guy on the left seems to outclass the singer...</td>', 'good energy, but the guy on the left seems to outclass the singer...', '2005-08-17 14:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618571, 218371, 19672, '<td valign="top">Nice bar room shot....a little off angle on horizon...<br/> <br/>Good capture of the ambient lighting but loss on distinguishing of singer''s face</td>', 'Nice bar room shot....a little off angle on horizon... Good capture of the ambient lighting but loss on distinguishing of singer''s face', '2005-08-17 14:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618573, 217115, 19672, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice piano, sexy girl, good blue tone whil haveing main subject very well lit.</td>', 'Great shot, nice piano, sexy girl, good blue tone whil haveing main subject very well lit.', '2005-08-17 14:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618575, 218842, 19672, '<td valign="top">er....good pose but I''d have waited for the other photographer with the white bag to move, blends too much with the hat</td>', 'er....good pose but I''d have waited for the other photographer with the white bag to move, blends too much with the hat', '2005-08-17 14:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618576, 219110, 19672, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, great colors, nice blurred background, good expression cute face with hat...nice</td>', 'Very nice shot, great colors, nice blurred background, good expression cute face with hat...nice', '2005-08-17 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618577, 218138, 19672, '<td valign="top">choo choo...</td>', 'choo choo...', '2005-08-17 14:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618579, 218638, 19672, '<td valign="top">over exposed but done in a good way so as to maintain focus on the main subjjects...<br/> <br/>I wonder how this would look cropped, but nice catch none-the-less</td>', 'over exposed but done in a good way so as to maintain focus on the main subjjects... I wonder how this would look cropped, but nice catch none-the-less', '2005-08-17 14:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618581, 216714, 19672, '<td valign="top">bass, plugged in...at least the other guy strummed the strings to show us it was live.... ;)</td>', 'bass, plugged in...at least the other guy strummed the strings to show us it was live.... ;)', '2005-08-17 14:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618583, 218457, 40371, '<td valign="top">Photo shop much?</td>', 'Photo shop much?', '2005-08-17 14:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618584, 217705, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great expression, I just wish something was in focus. Face is uncomfortably close to the top of the frame for my taste.</td>', 'Great expression, I just wish something was in focus. Face is uncomfortably close to the top of the frame for my taste.', '2005-08-17 14:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618585, 218833, 19672, '<td valign="top">wOw  WoW  wOw<br/> <br/>Great shot, great hair, good facial capture, great subject, great smoke, good lighting. I''m going to give you a 9. And I think if you were to crop the bottom ledge out and experiment with saturation so as to desaturate the red cap in the center then you''d have a shot at a 10.</td>', 'wOw  WoW  wOw Great shot, great hair, good facial capture, great subject, great smoke, good lighting. I''m going to give you a 9. And I think if you were to crop the bottom ledge out and experiment with saturation so as to desaturate the red cap in the center then you''d have a shot at a 10.', '2005-08-17 14:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
