(1618633, 219054, 8522, '<td valign="top">Photos with audience usually look like a snapshot unless they have their hands in the air or there''s amazing lighting on them. At least this one''s reasonably sharp though, very steady hands. Doesn''t look like an exceptionally exciting moment on stage at the moment you took the shot.</td>', 'Photos with audience usually look like a snapshot unless they have their hands in the air or there''s amazing lighting on them. At least this one''s reasonably sharp though, very steady hands. Doesn''t look like an exceptionally exciting moment on stage at the moment you took the shot.', '2005-08-17 14:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
