(1618691, 218700, 17722, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast, low lighting and feel of this photo. Nice</td>', 'Love the contrast, low lighting and feel of this photo. Nice', '2005-08-17 15:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618693, 218664, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but not really sure what to make of it for this challenge. Perhaps for a ''dead music'' challenge? ;-) I think he should be a tad less transparent. I do feel I have to vote this down for not meeting the challenge, but I do think it is a good shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but not really sure what to make of it for this challenge. Perhaps for a ''dead music'' challenge? ;-) I think he should be a tad less transparent. I do feel I have to vote this down for not meeting the challenge, but I do think it is a good shot.', '2005-08-17 15:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618696, 218815, 8522, '<td valign="top">Gamma seems a bit high. I would have tried to get him at a better angle so his eyes were clearer. Certainly interesting attire.</td>', 'Gamma seems a bit high. I would have tried to get him at a better angle so his eyes were clearer. Certainly interesting attire.', '2005-08-17 15:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618697, 218832, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t communicate live music to me. Not sure why his jeans are the only part of the photo to be in focus, this really needs to be the face. Could do with far more contrast, and not really a fan of the sepia used here.</td>', 'Doesn''t communicate live music to me. Not sure why his jeans are the only part of the photo to be in focus, this really needs to be the face. Could do with far more contrast, and not really a fan of the sepia used here.', '2005-08-17 15:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618698, 218970, 17722, '<td valign="top">I think this is a strong picture and it is one of my faves, but it might have benefited from a portrait framing instead fo this square one.</td>', 'I think this is a strong picture and it is one of my faves, but it might have benefited from a portrait framing instead fo this square one.', '2005-08-17 15:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618700, 219063, 8522, '<td valign="top">A bit too much like a snapshot with no clear point of focus.</td>', 'A bit too much like a snapshot with no clear point of focus.', '2005-08-17 15:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618702, 218733, 8522, '<td valign="top">Composition is all over the place, not sure what we''re meant to be focusing on. Bassist looking out of the frame leads viewer''s eye out of the photo. I''m missing the headstock on the bass. Placement of subjects in photo feels very unbalanced.</td>', 'Composition is all over the place, not sure what we''re meant to be focusing on. Bassist looking out of the frame leads viewer''s eye out of the photo. I''m missing the headstock on the bass. Placement of subjects in photo feels very unbalanced.', '2005-08-17 15:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618705, 218856, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t communicate live music to me. Onboard flash has resulted in unappealing shadows and glare off the floor. Also, head has unattractive glare. Toes and headstock are chopped off. Use of flash has given no sense of atmosphere and mood.</td>', 'Doesn''t communicate live music to me. Onboard flash has resulted in unappealing shadows and glare off the floor. Also, head has unattractive glare. Toes and headstock are chopped off. Use of flash has given no sense of atmosphere and mood.', '2005-08-17 15:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618714, 218970, 8522, '<td valign="top">Photo doesn''t convey much of a sense of ''cookin''''. I feel the dof should have extended to both hands, or been much shallower to say one finger. Range of tones doesn''t work for me, there are burnt out highlights and not much shadow detail. This would work well as a study of light and shadow, but it''s not succeeded on that level here.</td>', 'Photo doesn''t convey much of a sense of ''cookin''''. I feel the dof should have extended to both hands, or been much shallower to say one finger. Range of tones doesn''t work for me, there are burnt out highlights and not much shadow detail. This would work well as a study of light and shadow, but it''s not succeeded on that level here.', '2005-08-17 15:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618715, 219012, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great moment, but shame about the distracting background. I''d have tried to get closer or on the stage to get just blue sky behind him.</td>', 'Great moment, but shame about the distracting background. I''d have tried to get closer or on the stage to get just blue sky behind him.', '2005-08-17 15:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618717, 218464, 36456, '<td valign="top">nice photo, nice model - shame about the title</td>', 'nice photo, nice model - shame about the title', '2005-08-17 15:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618718, 218078, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but I feel the composition lets it down. It feels like you just tried to fill the frame with everything that was needed without considering whether it felt balanced or not. Could do with a little more contrast.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but I feel the composition lets it down. It feels like you just tried to fill the frame with everything that was needed without considering whether it felt balanced or not. Could do with a little more contrast.', '2005-08-17 15:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618720, 216830, 8522, '<td valign="top">I like the backlighting, and the silhouette of the end of the trumpet. I wish it was much sharper though.</td>', 'I like the backlighting, and the silhouette of the end of the trumpet. I wish it was much sharper though.', '2005-08-17 15:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618731, 217240, 41554, '<td valign="top">I think you tried to capture the mood of the thing, but I think it would have been nicer to have a close-up of the band. There is little detail and it seems a bit blurry.</td>', 'I think you tried to capture the mood of the thing, but I think it would have been nicer to have a close-up of the band. There is little detail and it seems a bit blurry.', '2005-08-17 15:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618736, 219012, 41554, '<td valign="top">Amen! Very nice shot, great light and excellent detail. The singer''s expression is just right. A great photo.</td>', 'Amen! Very nice shot, great light and excellent detail. The singer''s expression is just right. A great photo.', '2005-08-17 15:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618740, 217392, 3569, '<td valign="top">great shot, love the saw</td>', 'great shot, love the saw', '2005-08-17 15:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618744, 218800, 8522, '<td valign="top">Must be very uncomfortable for the musicians! Unfortunately my attention keeps being drawn to the chap standing at the front who has some foliage obstructing his face. It''s a huge shame about the burnt out sky. I have to say that I think the shot would have worked much better zooming into the musicians in the foliage, which would have emphasised how packed in they are there.</td>', 'Must be very uncomfortable for the musicians! Unfortunately my attention keeps being drawn to the chap standing at the front who has some foliage obstructing his face. It''s a huge shame about the burnt out sky. I have to say that I think the shot would have worked much better zooming into the musicians in the foliage, which would have emphasised how packed in they are there.', '2005-08-17 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618745, 218798, 41554, '<td valign="top">Not the greatest of compositions and background. Maybe you should have tried to capture an instrument''s detail or something.</td>', 'Not the greatest of compositions and background. Maybe you should have tried to capture an instrument''s detail or something.', '2005-08-17 15:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618749, 217967, 41554, '<td valign="top">I love shots with windows! Nice composition, excellent light and colour. A great shot.</td>', 'I love shots with windows! Nice composition, excellent light and colour. A great shot.', '2005-08-17 15:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618751, 218909, 8522, '<td valign="top">A lovely moment, but looks a bit like a snapshot. The elbow of the guy on the right really spoils the shot. There''s just too much happening here for the eye to settle. The guy who''s singing should really be the main subject, but his hand has been chopped off here, and he doesn''t have an important place within the shot.</td>', 'A lovely moment, but looks a bit like a snapshot. The elbow of the guy on the right really spoils the shot. There''s just too much happening here for the eye to settle. The guy who''s singing should really be the main subject, but his hand has been chopped off here, and he doesn''t have an important place within the shot.', '2005-08-17 15:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618753, 218188, 8522, '<td valign="top">Dreaming of a shot that meets the challenge...</td>', 'Dreaming of a shot that meets the challenge...', '2005-08-17 15:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618754, 218430, 5508, '<td valign="top">lol... calculator watch. Wow that brings me back.</td>', 'lol... calculator watch. Wow that brings me back.', '2005-08-17 15:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618758, 217420, 8522, '<td valign="top">Did you use flash? If so, you''ve burnt out the highlights on the shirt with it, try bouncing the flash. It''s a classic composition, but wait until he has a really good expression, say at the climax of the piece.</td>', 'Did you use flash? If so, you''ve burnt out the highlights on the shirt with it, try bouncing the flash. It''s a classic composition, but wait until he has a really good expression, say at the climax of the piece.', '2005-08-17 15:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618762, 217426, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks like a perfectly acceptable shot before you butchered it.</td>', 'Looks like a perfectly acceptable shot before you butchered it.', '2005-08-17 15:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
