(1618945, 218610, 8522, '<td valign="top">Live music?</td>', 'Live music?', '2005-08-17 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618948, 218666, 40718, '<td valign="top">Good capture of expression.  The slanted composition is a good idea in these settings.  I like the light background too.  8.</td>', 'Good capture of expression.  The slanted composition is a good idea in these settings.  I like the light background too.  8.', '2005-08-17 16:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618949, 218555, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks too NeatImaged/blurred to me. Either more or less blue sky would have worked better for me. Here, his eyes are almost in the centre of the shot which seems a bit unimaginative.</td>', 'Looks too NeatImaged/blurred to me. Either more or less blue sky would have worked better for me. Here, his eyes are almost in the centre of the shot which seems a bit unimaginative.', '2005-08-17 16:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618950, 217369, 8522, '<td valign="top">Don''t see any live music here.</td>', 'Don''t see any live music here.', '2005-08-17 16:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618953, 218891, 40718, '<td valign="top">OK, although a strict interpretation of the challenge would count this one out, I liked it so much I am willing to stretch the box.  The floating head in the door is really what makes the picture.  7, as high as I can give a generally off-topic pic.</td>', 'OK, although a strict interpretation of the challenge would count this one out, I liked it so much I am willing to stretch the box.  The floating head in the door is really what makes the picture.  7, as high as I can give a generally off-topic pic.', '2005-08-17 16:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618955, 218324, 40718, '<td valign="top">the man''s eyes make this picture...</td>', 'the man''s eyes make this picture...', '2005-08-17 16:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618956, 217873, 8522, '<td valign="top">This snapshot is way too cluttered, there''s no clear place for the eyes to rest, the trees especially are too distracting. Perhaps getting in close to the dancing couple with the musicians in the background could have made a better picture?</td>', 'This snapshot is way too cluttered, there''s no clear place for the eyes to rest, the trees especially are too distracting. Perhaps getting in close to the dancing couple with the musicians in the background could have made a better picture?', '2005-08-17 16:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618959, 218151, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the selective color desaturation, although it makes the bearded guy at the end look a bit funny.  7.</td>', 'I like the selective color desaturation, although it makes the bearded guy at the end look a bit funny.  7.', '2005-08-17 16:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618960, 217048, 8522, '<td valign="top">What a great backdrop behind the drummer! Nice light, although this shot is sadly overexposed so we miss a lot of the effect of being bathed in light. Nothing seems particularly in focus, and I think the placement of the drummer in the shot doesn''t work compositionally.</td>', 'What a great backdrop behind the drummer! Nice light, although this shot is sadly overexposed so we miss a lot of the effect of being bathed in light. Nothing seems particularly in focus, and I think the placement of the drummer in the shot doesn''t work compositionally.', '2005-08-17 16:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618961, 216805, 40718, '<td valign="top">an ordinary picture, except the reflection in the sunglasses.  Excellent capture. 7</td>', 'an ordinary picture, except the reflection in the sunglasses.  Excellent capture. 7', '2005-08-17 16:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618962, 218615, 8522, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a sense of live music from this shot.</td>', 'I don''t get a sense of live music from this shot.', '2005-08-17 16:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618965, 217716, 35739, '<td valign="top">The white is a tad too harsh.  Possibly overexposed.</td>', 'The white is a tad too harsh.  Possibly overexposed.', '2005-08-17 16:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618966, 217432, 40718, '<td valign="top">Man, can you believe his last name is actually McBagpipe?  Seriously though, this my favorite of the "parade" genre.  The focus isolates the subject, but the background is still discernible enough for context. 7.</td>', 'Man, can you believe his last name is actually McBagpipe?  Seriously though, this my favorite of the "parade" genre.  The focus isolates the subject, but the background is still discernible enough for context. 7.', '2005-08-17 16:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618972, 216222, 8522, '<td valign="top">That''s terrible jpeg artifacting all over the shot, or is it caused by a combination of high compression and NeatImage? Not particularly imaginative composition, and I feel his face is too near the top edge of the frame. I''ve never heard of him, but I hope you enjoyed this comical looking guy.</td>', 'That''s terrible jpeg artifacting all over the shot, or is it caused by a combination of high compression and NeatImage? Not particularly imaginative composition, and I feel his face is too near the top edge of the frame. I''ve never heard of him, but I hope you enjoyed this comical looking guy.', '2005-08-17 16:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618973, 218490, 40718, '<td valign="top">That Tori, she''s such a freak.  I''m not sure where she learned to keep her legs open while playing the piano, but she does that everywhere.  Good capture though.  Maybe bring the piano out just a little more from the background as it helps define the performer (meaning we associate Tori with a piano).</td>', 'That Tori, she''s such a freak.  I''m not sure where she learned to keep her legs open while playing the piano, but she does that everywhere.  Good capture though.  Maybe bring the piano out just a little more from the background as it helps define the performer (meaning we associate Tori with a piano).', '2005-08-17 16:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1618976, 217142, 40718, '<td valign="top">good colors in this one. I l ike the primary colors of red, blue and green all mixed well in one shot. 7.</td>', 'good colors in this one. I l ike the primary colors of red, blue and green all mixed well in one shot. 7.', '2005-08-17 16:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
