(1618979, 218254, 40718, '<td valign="top">background is nice.  Both subtle but yet not black.  The contrast might be a little overdone on the performer, but it isn''t too bad. 8.</td>', 'background is nice.  Both subtle but yet not black.  The contrast might be a little overdone on the performer, but it isn''t too bad. 8.', '2005-08-17 16:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
