(1621616, 218972, 35741, '<td valign="top">There are fine elements in this pic but the implementation could have been better. First, the object is a bit out of focus and moreover right in the middle of the photo. I would have moved the musician to the left and concentrated more on her and cropped courageously the background.</td>', 'There are fine elements in this pic but the implementation could have been better. First, the object is a bit out of focus and moreover right in the middle of the photo. I would have moved the musician to the left and concentrated more on her and cropped courageously the background.', '2005-08-18 16:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621621, 217762, 35741, '<td valign="top">I think this pic would have better with more courageous cropping. Now there are too much dark and empty space up right. I would have cropped one third from up and one fourth from left. But a great moment have been shotted!</td>', 'I think this pic would have better with more courageous cropping. Now there are too much dark and empty space up right. I would have cropped one third from up and one fourth from left. But a great moment have been shotted!', '2005-08-18 16:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1621628, 218248, 35741, '<td valign="top">I like this pic and its feeling a lot. But, however, I think it would been even better with something in up right. Maybe a full moon?</td>', 'I like this pic and its feeling a lot. But, however, I think it would been even better with something in up right. Maybe a full moon?', '2005-08-18 16:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
