(1621641, 216805, 35741, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this pic a lot, a crowd in sunglasses! But the fist of a singer covers too much his face. The function of this pic is a bit up in the air.</td>', 'I like the idea of this pic a lot, a crowd in sunglasses! But the fist of a singer covers too much his face. The function of this pic is a bit up in the air.', '2005-08-18 16:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
