(1621755, 218665, 37909, '<td valign="top">you''ll probably hear this alot:  pic is too small, and of too low resolution to fare too well.  flash fall off, and dim subject won''t help you either.  the blonde''s head detracts too much attention from the barely distinguishable band.</td>', 'you''ll probably hear this alot:  pic is too small, and of too low resolution to fare too well.  flash fall off, and dim subject won''t help you either.  the blonde''s head detracts too much attention from the barely distinguishable band.', '2005-08-18 17:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
