(1622178, 216940, 38818, '<td valign="top">I really really really like this shot. Wow. I have to say it''s one of my favorites of the challenge. I don''t know why, but it just hits me. The contrast is perfect, the levels are perfect, and composition is awesome. I have to give this a 9. Would give it a 10, but in other photos, there is more emotions on the musicians faces, but a 9 is the highest I''ve voted thus far. Outstanding!</td>', 'I really really really like this shot. Wow. I have to say it''s one of my favorites of the challenge. I don''t know why, but it just hits me. The contrast is perfect, the levels are perfect, and composition is awesome. I have to give this a 9. Would give it a 10, but in other photos, there is more emotions on the musicians faces, but a 9 is the highest I''ve voted thus far. Outstanding!', '2005-08-18 20:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
