(1622679, 217819, 23294, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  A few things that I think take away from it.  1. the jaggies on the arm are pretty harsh, perhaps a different resize method might help fight this.  2. the neat image or whatever smoothing technique was used, looks to have turned this into a plastic covered shot.  Other than that the composition is very good, and the model has a great presence in the shot.  One of my favorites. 8.</td>', 'Great shot.  A few things that I think take away from it.  1. the jaggies on the arm are pretty harsh, perhaps a different resize method might help fight this.  2. the neat image or whatever smoothing technique was used, looks to have turned this into a plastic covered shot.  Other than that the composition is very good, and the model has a great presence in the shot.  One of my favorites. 8.', '2005-08-18 23:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
