(1624477, 218891, 36888, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite!!!  Very humorous approach to the subject. 9</td>', 'This is my favorite!!!  Very humorous approach to the subject. 9', '2005-08-19 18:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624501, 218664, 3032, '<td valign="top">You really need to look hard to see the phantom. A good thing I think.</td>', 'You really need to look hard to see the phantom. A good thing I think.', '2005-08-19 18:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624509, 218582, 3032, '<td valign="top">Somehow you want and expect supersharp technical excellent pics. But those do not always fit the theme. The softness and psychedelic colors might work well with their kind of music, it tells more about the band.<br/>The composition could be better with a move to the right. Include the guitar player, there is enough room at the left. Now it is too centered on the singer, causing the guitar player to be cut off. 6.</td>', 'Somehow you want and expect supersharp technical excellent pics. But those do not always fit the theme. The softness and psychedelic colors might work well with their kind of music, it tells more about the band.The composition could be better with a move to the right. Include the guitar player, there is enough room at the left. Now it is too centered on the singer, causing the guitar player to be cut off. 6.', '2005-08-19 18:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624518, 218328, 3032, '<td valign="top">The way the light works with her hair and how her hair flows  keeps my eye in top of the frame, looking at here face. I like that effect. Under normal circumstances (when you are not limited to dpc basic ruls) you''d probably clone out the light above the head. So let''s think that away and you''ve got a good portrait. 7</td>', 'The way the light works with her hair and how her hair flows  keeps my eye in top of the frame, looking at here face. I like that effect. Under normal circumstances (when you are not limited to dpc basic ruls) you''d probably clone out the light above the head. So let''s think that away and you''ve got a good portrait. 7', '2005-08-19 18:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624522, 218557, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice strong diagonal, the uninteresting background is well hidden (during the first few important seconds you look at a pic) by the aperture you used. Interesting content, good composition and good B&amp;W toning.</td>', 'Nice strong diagonal, the uninteresting background is well hidden (during the first few important seconds you look at a pic) by the aperture you used. Interesting content, good composition and good B&W toning.', '2005-08-19 18:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624527, 218838, 3032, '<td valign="top">Holy cow, are there still artist wearing such suits? :)</td>', 'Holy cow, are there still artist wearing such suits? :)', '2005-08-19 18:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624535, 217856, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great shot, because it perfectly shows the interaction between the musician and his audience. It also looks as if you were pretty close, it shows, as a viewer I feel like I was present.  Besides that you''ve got great lighting and perfect B&amp;W toning. 10 &amp; fav!</td>', 'Great shot, because it perfectly shows the interaction between the musician and his audience. It also looks as if you were pretty close, it shows, as a viewer I feel like I was present.  Besides that you''ve got great lighting and perfect B&W toning. 10 & fav!', '2005-08-19 18:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624541, 217464, 3032, '<td valign="top">The crap^h^h^h^bs were all ears. :)<br/>Great shot, I like it how the big empty space to the right works out. 9</td>', 'The crap^h^h^h^bs were all ears. :)Great shot, I like it how the big empty space to the right works out. 9', '2005-08-19 19:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624549, 217170, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great photo. 9</td>', 'Great photo. 9', '2005-08-19 19:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624560, 218882, 3032, '<td valign="top">With a shot like this you miss the elements that really tell you that you are looking at a performing opera singer. Apart from that I like the way the foreground singer is lit, it just needs more expression on her face I think. I''m uncertain about the background. While it is excellently thrown out of focus, the background person is so bright that she is distracting.</td>', 'With a shot like this you miss the elements that really tell you that you are looking at a performing opera singer. Apart from that I like the way the foreground singer is lit, it just needs more expression on her face I think. I''m uncertain about the background. While it is excellently thrown out of focus, the background person is so bright that she is distracting.', '2005-08-19 19:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624565, 217009, 3032, '<td valign="top">Amsterdam?<br/>I like the mood/ambiance of this photo</td>', 'Amsterdam?I like the mood/ambiance of this photo', '2005-08-19 19:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624567, 218341, 40797, '<td valign="top">A little blury but other wise nice.</td>', 'A little blury but other wise nice.', '2005-08-19 19:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624571, 218521, 40797, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but I am not sure that I care the angle that it was taken at.</td>', 'Nice picture but I am not sure that I care the angle that it was taken at.', '2005-08-19 19:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624572, 218815, 3032, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure but usually it is Jamiroquai who wears such hats.</td>', 'I''m not sure but usually it is Jamiroquai who wears such hats.', '2005-08-19 19:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624574, 219054, 40797, '<td valign="top">Your  subject is a little far off for my taste.</td>', 'Your  subject is a little far off for my taste.', '2005-08-19 19:16:32.000000', NULL, 1);
