(1624710, 218845, 6667, '<td valign="top">While I love this shot for many reasons (We had a young lady in our family who started on one of these and went ont to become very proficient with the French horn), I am drawn to the legs.  For some odd reason they seam out of proprtion to the young lady. . . for that mater. . .  the same for the clarinet.  Still a very beatiful shot. BOL 7</td>', 'While I love this shot for many reasons (We had a young lady in our family who started on one of these and went ont to become very proficient with the French horn), I am drawn to the legs.  For some odd reason they seam out of proprtion to the young lady. . . for that mater. . .  the same for the clarinet.  Still a very beatiful shot. BOL 7', '2005-08-19 20:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
