(1624732, 217392, 40797, '<td valign="top">You captured a nice facial expression on your subjects face. I like the effect of the audience standing  in the background. Beautiful clean picture. Good luck</td>', 'You captured a nice facial expression on your subjects face. I like the effect of the audience standing  in the background. Beautiful clean picture. Good luck', '2005-08-19 20:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624736, 217464, 40797, '<td valign="top">Nice serrene picture.</td>', 'Nice serrene picture.', '2005-08-19 20:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1624737, 218970, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, there are several things that many would say are wrong with this shot...  It''s cropped very tight at the bottom.  It''s square crop which IMHO is very hard to make look ''natural'' for lack of a better term.  The focus is a little shallow as shown most by his right hand pinkie.  Ya cut the guys freakin head of for god''s sake.  But the more I look at it the more I feel that the gentleman here has a great love of life and music and has enjoyed all of it.  I can here him playing...<br/>Break the rules some more, I beg ya.<br/>TC<br/>I felt drawn back to this shot and tears came to my eyes because I realized part of why this moves me so much.  Put a guitar in this gentlemans hands and this would be my father if he were still alive...  Thank you for this.</td>', 'Wow, there are several things that many would say are wrong with this shot...  It''s cropped very tight at the bottom.  It''s square crop which IMHO is very hard to make look ''natural'' for lack of a better term.  The focus is a little shallow as shown most by his right hand pinkie.  Ya cut the guys freakin head of for god''s sake.  But the more I look at it the more I feel that the gentleman here has a great love of life and music and has enjoyed all of it.  I can here him playing...Break the rules some more, I beg ya.TCI felt drawn back to this shot and tears came to my eyes because I realized part of why this moves me so much.  Put a guitar in this gentlemans hands and this would be my father if he were still alive...  Thank you for this.', '2005-08-19 20:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
