(1625003, 217819, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Almost looks to plastic though.  Did you NeatImage it?  Great composition.  Looks like it was a great show.  You captured the energy of the show.  You do have some jaggies and what looks like oversharpening artifacts.  The first may be from resizing and the second may be just the back lighting but I don''t think so.  One of the best indoor concert type shots I''ve seen so far!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice capture.  Almost looks to plastic though.  Did you NeatImage it?  Great composition.  Looks like it was a great show.  You captured the energy of the show.  You do have some jaggies and what looks like oversharpening artifacts.  The first may be from resizing and the second may be just the back lighting but I don''t think so.  One of the best indoor concert type shots I''ve seen so far!TC', '2005-08-19 22:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625017, 216769, 9906, '<td valign="top">The yellow background is not very appealing to the rest of the shot.  It almost looks like it was added after the fact in post processing.<br/>TC</td>', 'The yellow background is not very appealing to the rest of the shot.  It almost looks like it was added after the fact in post processing.TC', '2005-08-19 22:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
