(1625083, 218641, 18191, '<td valign="top">I don''t think that the angle/perspective choice is as flattering as it could be. There is not central point of interest for the viewer to see and thus it is a slightly confusing interest. There are good lines however... try experimenting and working with them to get a more dynamic composition</td>', 'I don''t think that the angle/perspective choice is as flattering as it could be. There is not central point of interest for the viewer to see and thus it is a slightly confusing interest. There are good lines however... try experimenting and working with them to get a more dynamic composition', '2005-08-19 23:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
