(1625157, 218845, 36597, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photograph... Usually, I like sharper images but... in this image soft focus is really complimentary! I can almost hear the clarinets, soft woody sound. My compliments and thank-you.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photograph... Usually, I like sharper images but... in this image soft focus is really complimentary! I can almost hear the clarinets, soft woody sound. My compliments and thank-you.', '2005-08-19 23:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625195, 219110, 36597, '<td valign="top">You captured the moment!  You''ll have to thank Jessica, for wearing such a nice color pallet and pat yourself on the back for a great photo! I''m picking up a little extra colour on her arms... maybe green? Anyway, I like it... Congratulations on a nice photo!</td>', 'You captured the moment!  You''ll have to thank Jessica, for wearing such a nice color pallet and pat yourself on the back for a great photo! I''m picking up a little extra colour on her arms... maybe green? Anyway, I like it... Congratulations on a nice photo!', '2005-08-19 23:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
