(1625223, 216663, 36597, '<td valign="top">Normally, I like a sharper mage. That being said, I like the little bit of movement... to me this adds to the image. I''m seeing a little too much red on the guitar... especially on the upper horn. Could be the lighting? Anyway, I like the results! Congratulations!</td>', 'Normally, I like a sharper mage. That being said, I like the little bit of movement... to me this adds to the image. I''m seeing a little too much red on the guitar... especially on the upper horn. Could be the lighting? Anyway, I like the results! Congratulations!', '2005-08-19 23:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
