(1625261, 218046, 36597, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had to work on this one. This guys hair looks shaded and he is pixilated... (under a canopy?) while, the background is overexposed. In situations like this, I would probably get in for a tighter shot or a different angle. Good Luck!</td>', 'Looks like you had to work on this one. This guys hair looks shaded and he is pixilated... (under a canopy?) while, the background is overexposed. In situations like this, I would probably get in for a tighter shot or a different angle. Good Luck!', '2005-08-20 00:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
