(1625410, 218700, 41680, '<td valign="top">Great feel to this, love the lighting and tones.  Unique shot.</td>', 'Great feel to this, love the lighting and tones.  Unique shot.', '2005-08-20 01:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625413, 216452, 41680, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective, but the lighting kind of ruins the shot for me.  The flash has cast harsh light on the top of the head, making it excessively bright.  My eyes go first to the scalp instead of the main subject, which is the hands playing the piano.  I''d try using more ambient light next time.</td>', 'Neat perspective, but the lighting kind of ruins the shot for me.  The flash has cast harsh light on the top of the head, making it excessively bright.  My eyes go first to the scalp instead of the main subject, which is the hands playing the piano.  I''d try using more ambient light next time.', '2005-08-20 01:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625415, 218725, 41680, '<td valign="top">Excellent energy, I like the fog in the back.</td>', 'Excellent energy, I like the fog in the back.', '2005-08-20 01:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625416, 218856, 41680, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, but the lighting doesn''t do it for me.  I''d try using the ambient light more next time, to give it a more intimate, moody, and artistic feel.</td>', 'Interesting perspective, but the lighting doesn''t do it for me.  I''d try using the ambient light more next time, to give it a more intimate, moody, and artistic feel.', '2005-08-20 01:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625418, 218664, 41680, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and tones here.  Strangely, I would have liked to see more of the ''phantom.''  Right now I can hardly tell if there''s supposed to be someone/something or not.  Even if the someone/something is not supposed to be clear, I would have liked the concept to be stronger.  I like the idea.</td>', 'Love the lighting and tones here.  Strangely, I would have liked to see more of the ''phantom.''  Right now I can hardly tell if there''s supposed to be someone/something or not.  Even if the someone/something is not supposed to be clear, I would have liked the concept to be stronger.  I like the idea.', '2005-08-20 01:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625420, 217508, 41680, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but it seems more like a portrait (even if it is of a musician) than a capture of live music.</td>', 'I like the idea, but it seems more like a portrait (even if it is of a musician) than a capture of live music.', '2005-08-20 01:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
