(1625798, 216946, 3306, '<td valign="top">Well done portrait. The backlighting is really eyecatching and makes this shot stand out. Good job on focus and lighting. Even gives the feeling of movement with that slight hand blur.</td>', 'Well done portrait. The backlighting is really eyecatching and makes this shot stand out. Good job on focus and lighting. Even gives the feeling of movement with that slight hand blur.', '2005-08-20 08:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625799, 218382, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed. Great emotion. Difficult shot under such low light conditions.</td>', 'Very nicely composed. Great emotion. Difficult shot under such low light conditions.', '2005-08-20 08:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625801, 217464, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like when a shot tells a story. This one does. Good use of negative space and texture to add interest to the scene.</td>', 'I like when a shot tells a story. This one does. Good use of negative space and texture to add interest to the scene.', '2005-08-20 08:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625802, 218845, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very nice silhouette image. Love the backround color. Very well done.</td>', 'Very nice silhouette image. Love the backround color. Very well done.', '2005-08-20 08:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625804, 217160, 3306, '<td valign="top">A great capture of emotion and intensity. He obviously works hard at his craft and you have exemplified it well.</td>', 'A great capture of emotion and intensity. He obviously works hard at his craft and you have exemplified it well.', '2005-08-20 08:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625807, 218464, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot. I really like the way you positioned the artist in the frame. The lighting is excellent. One small criticism is the subjects head position. It just looks a little too set up. I would have preferred her looking anywhere but up to the heavens!!</td>', 'This is a lovely shot. I really like the way you positioned the artist in the frame. The lighting is excellent. One small criticism is the subjects head position. It just looks a little too set up. I would have preferred her looking anywhere but up to the heavens!!', '2005-08-20 08:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625808, 218248, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice. This would have done very well in the "Nude" Challenge. Very tasteful. I am sure it will do well here too.</td>', 'Nice. This would have done very well in the "Nude" Challenge. Very tasteful. I am sure it will do well here too.', '2005-08-20 08:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625811, 218700, 3306, '<td valign="top">Love the emotion in this shot. Low light and movement make it a  very difficult capture. You have done well here.</td>', 'Love the emotion in this shot. Low light and movement make it a  very difficult capture. You have done well here.', '2005-08-20 08:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625812, 217867, 3306, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. Nice shot.</td>', 'Simple and effective. Nice shot.', '2005-08-20 08:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625814, 218557, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nicely arranged and positioned in the frame. The backround is a little distracting, but that is something I am sure you had no control over.</td>', 'Nicely arranged and positioned in the frame. The backround is a little distracting, but that is something I am sure you had no control over.', '2005-08-20 08:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625817, 218597, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. I am wondering what it would look like if you rotated it clockwise a little to make it look like the artist is bending back. It would add emotion. Just a thought.</td>', 'I like this shot. I am wondering what it would look like if you rotated it clockwise a little to make it look like the artist is bending back. It would add emotion. Just a thought.', '2005-08-20 08:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625821, 217149, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. I like the backround. Some small areas of burn out but otherwise very well done.</td>', 'Nicely composed. I like the backround. Some small areas of burn out but otherwise very well done.', '2005-08-20 08:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625827, 218638, 30364, '<td valign="top">Good Grief!  Is this a Sri Lankan bagpipe player?  I can''t imagine what that might sound like, but it looks pretty good in your photograph.  I particularly like the expression on the second musician, which adds a lot of interest to the image.  7</td>', 'Good Grief!  Is this a Sri Lankan bagpipe player?  I can''t imagine what that might sound like, but it looks pretty good in your photograph.  I particularly like the expression on the second musician, which adds a lot of interest to the image.  7', '2005-08-20 08:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625828, 218641, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely, silky photograph of my favourite instrument.  You don''t need another comment about the challenge being LIVE music, I guess?  Didn''t think so.  I can''t score it as highly as I might in some other challenge, but It''s a very beautiful image anyway.</td>', 'This is a lovely, silky photograph of my favourite instrument.  You don''t need another comment about the challenge being LIVE music, I guess?  Didn''t think so.  I can''t score it as highly as I might in some other challenge, but It''s a very beautiful image anyway.', '2005-08-20 08:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625831, 217048, 30364, '<td valign="top">Even though I really dislike this combination of colours, I have to score your image high because: (a) I am colourblind; and (b) it''s actually a quite original idea and composition. 7</td>', 'Even though I really dislike this combination of colours, I have to score your image high because: (a) I am colourblind; and (b) it''s actually a quite original idea and composition. 7', '2005-08-20 09:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625833, 218845, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely elegant pose from the model, and a simple and harmonious composition from the photographer.  8</td>', 'Lovely elegant pose from the model, and a simple and harmonious composition from the photographer.  8', '2005-08-20 09:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625835, 217967, 32767, '<td valign="top">This is a very very nice image. I would like to have seen the player slightly sharper.8</td>', 'This is a very very nice image. I would like to have seen the player slightly sharper.8', '2005-08-20 09:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625837, 218555, 32767, '<td valign="top">This image has great tones and feel but I think it has too much sky and not enough player. 7</td>', 'This image has great tones and feel but I think it has too much sky and not enough player. 7', '2005-08-20 09:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625838, 218866, 32767, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast and the angle of this image but the crop IMHO is uncomfortably tight. I would say that you needed either more of the players head or more of the guitars body.</td>', 'I like the contrast and the angle of this image but the crop IMHO is uncomfortably tight. I would say that you needed either more of the players head or more of the guitars body.', '2005-08-20 09:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625839, 217256, 30364, '<td valign="top">Really super photograph; a wonderful moment, perfectly captured.  It''s a National Geographic image.  Alas, it''s not a live music image.  I''m sure you know that, but thanks for entering it anyway ... it won''t score well but it will give us all a lot of pleasure.  It is just fabulous!  If only the buffalo had had a damned bell!</td>', 'Really super photograph; a wonderful moment, perfectly captured.  It''s a National Geographic image.  Alas, it''s not a live music image.  I''m sure you know that, but thanks for entering it anyway ... it won''t score well but it will give us all a lot of pleasure.  It is just fabulous!  If only the buffalo had had a damned bell!', '2005-08-20 09:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625840, 218883, 32767, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Nice crop, good definition but I do think that the lake is too overexposed.</td>', 'Very nice image. Nice crop, good definition but I do think that the lake is too overexposed.', '2005-08-20 09:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625844, 217142, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love bass.  Used to play one, but I never looked as cool as this guy.  It''s a nice composition and a crisp, professional-looking image.  7</td>', 'Love bass.  Used to play one, but I never looked as cool as this guy.  It''s a nice composition and a crisp, professional-looking image.  7', '2005-08-20 09:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625845, 217274, 32767, '<td valign="top">I usually NEVER comment on distractions because the world isn''t neat and perfect that way and sometimes things are what (or where) they are.<br/> <br/>This is one of the most fun images in the pack but those darn two heads. Sometimes you you need to just, break out the axe.</td>', 'I usually NEVER comment on distractions because the world isn''t neat and perfect that way and sometimes things are what (or where) they are. This is one of the most fun images in the pack but those darn two heads. Sometimes you you need to just, break out the axe.', '2005-08-20 09:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625865, 217724, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is nice, with a perfect title for the feel you''ve created.  Amid all the joy-less comments you''ll be getting about blown highlights, I''d like to say that I think your decision to expose &amp; process the photograph this way is very clever.  It establishes the relationship between the sax and the man''s rapt expression as the visual hinge on which your image swings.  So the peripheral margins aren''t blown at all; they''re just unimportant, to the man as well as to us.  Bravo.  9</td>', 'This is nice, with a perfect title for the feel you''ve created.  Amid all the joy-less comments you''ll be getting about blown highlights, I''d like to say that I think your decision to expose & process the photograph this way is very clever.  It establishes the relationship between the sax and the man''s rapt expression as the visual hinge on which your image swings.  So the peripheral margins aren''t blown at all; they''re just unimportant, to the man as well as to us.  Bravo.  9', '2005-08-20 09:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625877, 218667, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love those big V8''s.  Only the really tragic petrol-heads think it''s music, though!  Nice photo of Murph, anyway.</td>', 'Love those big V8''s.  Only the really tragic petrol-heads think it''s music, though!  Nice photo of Murph, anyway.', '2005-08-20 09:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625955, 218138, 9906, '<td valign="top">I thought the challenge was to photograph ''Live Music''.<br/>TC</td>', 'I thought the challenge was to photograph ''Live Music''.TC', '2005-08-20 10:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625959, 217392, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too bad for all the people in the background as the main subject is shot perfectly if a tad bit dark in the jacket...<br/>TC</td>', 'Too bad for all the people in the background as the main subject is shot perfectly if a tad bit dark in the jacket...TC', '2005-08-20 10:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625962, 218188, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like how you took recorded music and fit it in the ''Live Music'' challenge by using the title!  And to think I actually went looking...<br/>TC</td>', 'I like how you took recorded music and fit it in the ''Live Music'' challenge by using the title!  And to think I actually went looking...TC', '2005-08-20 10:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625969, 218718, 9906, '<td valign="top">Did this gentleman know you were shooting him?  It looks like a long distance shot from behind the bushes...  The background is distracting.  If you shot from a different angle it may have been better.<br/>TC</td>', 'Did this gentleman know you were shooting him?  It looks like a long distance shot from behind the bushes...  The background is distracting.  If you shot from a different angle it may have been better.TC', '2005-08-20 10:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625971, 218370, 9906, '<td valign="top">To me this does not say live music.  It says staged studio type shot though done quite well...<br/>TC</td>', 'To me this does not say live music.  It says staged studio type shot though done quite well...TC', '2005-08-20 10:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625976, 218970, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love it, and I applaud your decision to go with just the hands.  Presumably this musician has a face that''s as interesting as these marvellous hands, but your approach, leaving the face to the viewer''s imagination, appeals to me more. 9</td>', 'Love it, and I applaud your decision to go with just the hands.  Presumably this musician has a face that''s as interesting as these marvellous hands, but your approach, leaving the face to the viewer''s imagination, appeals to me more. 9', '2005-08-20 10:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625979, 218664, 9906, '<td valign="top">By definition, can it be ''Live Music'' if it''s a phantom?  Nice shot.  Wish it fit the challenge better.  This shot to me says staged not ''go out and find Live Music''...<br/>TC</td>', 'By definition, can it be ''Live Music'' if it''s a phantom?  Nice shot.  Wish it fit the challenge better.  This shot to me says staged not ''go out and find Live Music''...TC', '2005-08-20 10:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625982, 219040, 9906, '<td valign="top">I do not understand why you want me to look at the blue jewelry...<br/>TC</td>', 'I do not understand why you want me to look at the blue jewelry...TC', '2005-08-20 10:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625983, 218891, 30222, '<td valign="top">ofcourse i could place some technical critical notes on this and that<br/>but this is BRILLIANT!!<br/>the scene the outofthebox the angle Caruso the frown the whole everything is so amusing!!<br/></td>', 'ofcourse i could place some technical critical notes on this and thatbut this is BRILLIANT!!the scene the outofthebox the angle Caruso the frown the whole everything is so amusing!!', '2005-08-20 10:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625984, 216960, 30222, '<td valign="top">i love toots and its a nice picture!</td>', 'i love toots and its a nice picture!', '2005-08-20 10:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625985, 217681, 9906, '<td valign="top">Your choice to use selective desat doesn''t make sense to me.  I don''t know what you are trying to convey with this style.<br/>TC</td>', 'Your choice to use selective desat doesn''t make sense to me.  I don''t know what you are trying to convey with this style.TC', '2005-08-20 11:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625988, 217443, 30222, '<td valign="top">all the technical minors could not prevent this from being a fantastic image<br/>life just jumps from the scene<br/>great shot!!</td>', 'all the technical minors could not prevent this from being a fantastic imagelife just jumps from the scenegreat shot!!', '2005-08-20 11:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625991, 218800, 24991, '<td valign="top">This is much more of a snapshot ant an artistic shot...no high praise from me, sorry.</td>', 'This is much more of a snapshot ant an artistic shot...no high praise from me, sorry.', '2005-08-20 11:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625992, 217586, 9906, '<td valign="top">I do not understand your message.  You obviously want me to look at the red body of the guitar, but I do not know why.  You used the flash for this shot didn''t you.  Did you try to take a blown out image and make it look better with the selective desat?  If that was what you were trying it won''t work.  You just end up with a blown out b/w shot.  To make b/w truly work, you need definition.  You need texture.  With the flash, you blew out both of those making it impossible for the b/w treatment to work.<br/>TC</td>', 'I do not understand your message.  You obviously want me to look at the red body of the guitar, but I do not know why.  You used the flash for this shot didn''t you.  Did you try to take a blown out image and make it look better with the selective desat?  If that was what you were trying it won''t work.  You just end up with a blown out b/w shot.  To make b/w truly work, you need definition.  You need texture.  With the flash, you blew out both of those making it impossible for the b/w treatment to work.TC', '2005-08-20 11:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625993, 217160, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very intense photograph, stripped to the bare essentials, and all the more successful for it.  8</td>', 'A very intense photograph, stripped to the bare essentials, and all the more successful for it.  8', '2005-08-20 11:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1625996, 218764, 9906, '<td valign="top">To me it never looks right to have a model on a third line facing out of the frame.  It makes me feel that I''m missing something.  Kinda like you''re cheating me outa half the view...<br/>TC</td>', 'To me it never looks right to have a model on a third line facing out of the frame.  It makes me feel that I''m missing something.  Kinda like you''re cheating me outa half the view...TC', '2005-08-20 11:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
