(1626005, 219011, 29906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2005-08-20 11:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626007, 218974, 9906, '<td valign="top">I do not believe that you have met the challenge with this shot.  The challenge said to go find ''Live'' music and photograph it.  This is obviously a set up shot.  Now that that''s out of the way...  You''ve cropped this (or shot it) way too tight.  It has no room to breath.  It''s also out of focus and looks very flat as if there wasn''t enough light.  Is this in a studio or some place where you can play with the lights?  Light it up from the side and the speaker and knobs would come alive with texture and you''ll be able to focus better if there is more light.<br/>TC</td>', 'I do not believe that you have met the challenge with this shot.  The challenge said to go find ''Live'' music and photograph it.  This is obviously a set up shot.  Now that that''s out of the way...  You''ve cropped this (or shot it) way too tight.  It has no room to breath.  It''s also out of focus and looks very flat as if there wasn''t enough light.  Is this in a studio or some place where you can play with the lights?  Light it up from the side and the speaker and knobs would come alive with texture and you''ll be able to focus better if there is more light.TC', '2005-08-20 11:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
