(1626060, 218151, 9906, '<td valign="top">The post processing on this one doesn''t work for me.  I don''t understand why you want me to look at the orange dress and the lighter skin tones just don''t work.  A true b/w treatment would have been more appropriate or a tri- or quad-tone maybe.  I would really like to see it in color...<br/>TC</td>', 'The post processing on this one doesn''t work for me.  I don''t understand why you want me to look at the orange dress and the lighter skin tones just don''t work.  A true b/w treatment would have been more appropriate or a tri- or quad-tone maybe.  I would really like to see it in color...TC', '2005-08-20 11:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626064, 217804, 35739, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast here.  I wish the subject was more in focus.  Good capture.  I may have cropped off some of the top so the second story would not show.</td>', 'I like the contrast here.  I wish the subject was more in focus.  Good capture.  I may have cropped off some of the top so the second story would not show.', '2005-08-20 11:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626068, 218700, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the post processing.  Like the low key effect.  Love the noise.  Like the focus.  Would like to see it in a straight up b/w.<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t care for the post processing.  Like the low key effect.  Love the noise.  Like the focus.  Would like to see it in a straight up b/w.TC', '2005-08-20 11:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
