(1626072, 218842, 35739, '<td valign="top">I like the scene here.  I do not like the harshness of his hat and the ladies bags.  They blend together a little too much. The subject is a little out of focus. What I like about the image is that you captured a non staged for camera point in time.  Those are the photo''s I like best.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the scene here.  I do not like the harshness of his hat and the ladies bags.  They blend together a little too much. The subject is a little out of focus. What I like about the image is that you captured a non staged for camera point in time.  Those are the photo''s I like best.  Good job.', '2005-08-20 11:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
