(1626402, 218411, 19959, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Did you tell him he''s ripped his pants!</td>', 'Great shot. Did you tell him he''s ripped his pants!', '2005-08-20 15:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626405, 217256, 19959, '<td valign="top">I''m confused!?</td>', 'I''m confused!?', '2005-08-20 15:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626415, 217508, 42198, '<td valign="top">''Lead Singer''? - But the only reason I know this is because of the title. Nothing in the photo indicates this person is a singer, or singing for that matter. On the positive side, I really liked the close-up cropping, and the gold paint reflections were well captured. .... hmmm unless you meant ''lead'' as in the metal, and that''s what the metallic paint represents? - Bit cryptic if that is the case.</td>', '''Lead Singer''? - But the only reason I know this is because of the title. Nothing in the photo indicates this person is a singer, or singing for that matter. On the positive side, I really liked the close-up cropping, and the gold paint reflections were well captured. .... hmmm unless you meant ''lead'' as in the metal, and that''s what the metallic paint represents? - Bit cryptic if that is the case.', '2005-08-20 16:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626416, 218845, 42198, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and colours. Bright orange trees on bottom lh corner distract the eye slightly. But overall an original, well thought out, and well presented shot.</td>', 'Excellent composition and colours. Bright orange trees on bottom lh corner distract the eye slightly. But overall an original, well thought out, and well presented shot.', '2005-08-20 16:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626420, 216643, 42198, '<td valign="top">Pity the microphone is so prominent, but there probably wasn''t much you could do about that. Overall very good, nice expression, good DOF and composition (apart from the mic). Colours are a bit muted.</td>', 'Pity the microphone is so prominent, but there probably wasn''t much you could do about that. Overall very good, nice expression, good DOF and composition (apart from the mic). Colours are a bit muted.', '2005-08-20 16:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626426, 218428, 42198, '<td valign="top">Would have been a good entry in an ''aircraft'' challenge. But just doesn''t fit the bill here. Good composition, and well captured though - I like the trails.</td>', 'Would have been a good entry in an ''aircraft'' challenge. But just doesn''t fit the bill here. Good composition, and well captured though - I like the trails.', '2005-08-20 16:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626433, 218188, 42198, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this just doesn''t work for me. The grain, focus and lighting detract from whatever idea you were trying to convey. Bit on the small side as well. On the positive side.... interesting ''blur'' effect on the left hand side, although I''m not sure is this because of JPG artifacts!</td>', 'Sorry, this just doesn''t work for me. The grain, focus and lighting detract from whatever idea you were trying to convey. Bit on the small side as well. On the positive side.... interesting ''blur'' effect on the left hand side, although I''m not sure is this because of JPG artifacts!', '2005-08-20 16:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626439, 218451, 42198, '<td valign="top">Would have done well in a nature challenge, but just doesn''t seem to fit into this one. Nice use of shutter speed and good DOF.</td>', 'Would have done well in a nature challenge, but just doesn''t seem to fit into this one. Nice use of shutter speed and good DOF.', '2005-08-20 16:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626441, 218852, 35444, '<td valign="top">It is a little dark.  Maybe curves could have helped?  Otherwise, GREAT capture!</td>', 'It is a little dark.  Maybe curves could have helped?  Otherwise, GREAT capture!', '2005-08-20 16:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626445, 218615, 42198, '<td valign="top">Cute photo - but I can''t see how it fits this challenge. The foreground object is very distracting, what is it, his hand? - Nice crop on his face though.</td>', 'Cute photo - but I can''t see how it fits this challenge. The foreground object is very distracting, what is it, his hand? - Nice crop on his face though.', '2005-08-20 16:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626448, 217274, 42198, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, really captured the moment. Perhaps a shallower DOF would keep my  attention away from these interesting people in the background?...  :-)</td>', 'Very nice shot, really captured the moment. Perhaps a shallower DOF would keep my  attention away from these interesting people in the background?...  :-)', '2005-08-20 16:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626449, 218610, 42198, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I just don''t get the link to ''live music''. Overall a good photo though. But colours are muted, and lighting is a bit ''grey'' - too much grey here! (Even a greener background would have offset it)</td>', 'Sorry, but I just don''t get the link to ''live music''. Overall a good photo though. But colours are muted, and lighting is a bit ''grey'' - too much grey here! (Even a greener background would have offset it)', '2005-08-20 16:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626453, 219040, 42198, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. But I find the hue/saturation changes you''ve applied cause the eye to get drawn to the jewellery and the buttons on the synth. And why a synth? - A real piano would be much nicer for this type of shot.</td>', 'Nice idea. But I find the hue/saturation changes you''ve applied cause the eye to get drawn to the jewellery and the buttons on the synth. And why a synth? - A real piano would be much nicer for this type of shot.', '2005-08-20 16:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
