(1626929, 217392, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s a very fine image (same can''t be said for your cheesy title, I''m afraid).  The composition is effective and, if you''ve cropped, then your crop is clever, too.  The intense expression of concentration on the subject is great, and his dark clothing contrasts well with the background people, giving him real visual impact.  Then exposure is also excellent.  It''s a photograph filled with interest and even intrigue (e.g. what''s with the hat; what''s that in his pocket; why are all the people''s arms folded; wonder if there were other instruments?) 9.  Nope; second thoughts = bump to 10.</td>', 'That''s a very fine image (same can''t be said for your cheesy title, I''m afraid).  The composition is effective and, if you''ve cropped, then your crop is clever, too.  The intense expression of concentration on the subject is great, and his dark clothing contrasts well with the background people, giving him real visual impact.  Then exposure is also excellent.  It''s a photograph filled with interest and even intrigue (e.g. what''s with the hat; what''s that in his pocket; why are all the people''s arms folded; wonder if there were other instruments?) 9.  Nope; second thoughts = bump to 10.', '2005-08-20 20:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626932, 217170, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Effective composition and a powerful capture of the connection between the musician and the passing couple.  Eye contact, both ways.  Also a meticulously exposed and processed image.  9</td>', 'Very nice.  Effective composition and a powerful capture of the connection between the musician and the passing couple.  Eye contact, both ways.  Also a meticulously exposed and processed image.  9', '2005-08-20 20:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626937, 218490, 38925, '<td valign="top">nice frame i really like it</td>', 'nice frame i really like it', '2005-08-20 20:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
