(1626942, 216618, 38925, '<td valign="top">nice shot i like it</td>', 'nice shot i like it', '2005-08-20 20:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626946, 218324, 30364, '<td valign="top">Man those eyes have got the blues!  This is a beautiful, evocative capture.  As well as being a technically fine photograph, what I especially admire is the mood you''ve created; so sympathetic to this musical genre.  Of course, the guy is responsible for a lot of that ... he''s the perfect bluesman!  9</td>', 'Man those eyes have got the blues!  This is a beautiful, evocative capture.  As well as being a technically fine photograph, what I especially admire is the mood you''ve created; so sympathetic to this musical genre.  Of course, the guy is responsible for a lot of that ... he''s the perfect bluesman!  9', '2005-08-20 20:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
