(1626953, 218891, 30364, '<td valign="top">A good, stupid idea ( I mean that in a caring and complimentary way!)  It''s actually planned and executed very well, and the result is a lot of fun.  Love the expressions on both the performer and his audience.  Also the vignetting in the corners, which makes it seem we are peeking through a hole.  It''s a very clever photograph.  Also a perfect title. 8</td>', 'A good, stupid idea ( I mean that in a caring and complimentary way!)  It''s actually planned and executed very well, and the result is a lot of fun.  Love the expressions on both the performer and his audience.  Also the vignetting in the corners, which makes it seem we are peeking through a hole.  It''s a very clever photograph.  Also a perfect title. 8', '2005-08-20 20:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626963, 217943, 31403, '<td valign="top">oh no, is THAT really what he looks like now?</td>', 'oh no, is THAT really what he looks like now?', '2005-08-20 20:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626968, 218666, 31403, '<td valign="top">too much slant for my taste</td>', 'too much slant for my taste', '2005-08-20 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626975, 218411, 31403, '<td valign="top">hope he sounded better than he looks</td>', 'hope he sounded better than he looks', '2005-08-20 21:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626977, 218841, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a charming image.  Lovely, spare composition; the subject is positioned well in relation to both the masonry behind him and the roadway extending up in front of him.  The folding chair, the furled umbrella, the neat bag and the cup combine to tell us a story about this man.  He''s an organised and proud street musician, and certainly not some scruffy, casual beggar.  I love photographs that stimulate thought.  9</td>', 'This is a charming image.  Lovely, spare composition; the subject is positioned well in relation to both the masonry behind him and the roadway extending up in front of him.  The folding chair, the furled umbrella, the neat bag and the cup combine to tell us a story about this man.  He''s an organised and proud street musician, and certainly not some scruffy, casual beggar.  I love photographs that stimulate thought.  9', '2005-08-20 21:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626981, 218478, 34763, '<td valign="top">great color and contrast, super pic<br/></td>', 'great color and contrast, super pic', '2005-08-20 21:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626984, 217464, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great concept!  Love the overall effect.  I however don''t think that you need as much negative space as you included.  I think you would have a more powerful image if the model and guitar took up roughly 1/4th the image.  Just my oppinion.  Oh by the way.  That''s an impressive border.  Really big!<br/>TC</td>', 'Great concept!  Love the overall effect.  I however don''t think that you need as much negative space as you included.  I think you would have a more powerful image if the model and guitar took up roughly 1/4th the image.  Just my oppinion.  Oh by the way.  That''s an impressive border.  Really big!TC', '2005-08-20 21:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1626985, 219043, 9906, '<td valign="top">Why do you want me to look at his tie?<br/>TC</td>', 'Why do you want me to look at his tie?TC', '2005-08-20 21:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
