(1627014, 218883, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s a wonderful shot, filled with joie-de-vivre.  The horizon police will be on your case ... hope they''ll at least take the time to appreciate your delightful candid photograph.  I wish I could hear these guys play ... I''ll bet they''d be a lot of fun.  7</td>', 'That''s a wonderful shot, filled with joie-de-vivre.  The horizon police will be on your case ... hope they''ll at least take the time to appreciate your delightful candid photograph.  I wish I could hear these guys play ... I''ll bet they''d be a lot of fun.  7', '2005-08-20 21:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627022, 219055, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love the composition.  Cropping the heads off the pedestrians was a very clever decision, as was including the glimpse of the approaching person, and thus explaining what the musician is looking at.  Also love the instruments; they also serve as furniture!  A very intelligent &amp; thoughtful image, loaded with allegory.  8</td>', 'Love the composition.  Cropping the heads off the pedestrians was a very clever decision, as was including the glimpse of the approaching person, and thus explaining what the musician is looking at.  Also love the instruments; they also serve as furniture!  A very intelligent & thoughtful image, loaded with allegory.  8', '2005-08-20 21:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627023, 218833, 30364, '<td valign="top">Don''t know this band.  They must pretty bad.  Your photograph is very effective, however.  I don''t mind the distracting equipment at the bottom; it reinforces the ''live'' feel.  7</td>', 'Don''t know this band.  They must pretty bad.  Your photograph is very effective, however.  I don''t mind the distracting equipment at the bottom; it reinforces the ''live'' feel.  7', '2005-08-20 21:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627030, 218259, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very nice street music image.  His facial expression is appealing, and the beer sign adds a lot to the impact. 7</td>', 'Very nice street music image.  His facial expression is appealing, and the beer sign adds a lot to the impact. 7', '2005-08-20 21:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627035, 218713, 30364, '<td valign="top">A really good drummer shot.  It''s a good (if almost inevtiable) composition, but the lighting and the exposure have lifted it above the ordinary.  7</td>', 'A really good drummer shot.  It''s a good (if almost inevtiable) composition, but the lighting and the exposure have lifted it above the ordinary.  7', '2005-08-20 21:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627054, 218382, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The spotlight and the bass''s neck work together to frame the musician very dramatically.  I also like the spare, stripped-to-the-bones feel of it.  Suits character of the instrument.  7</td>', 'Nice composition.  The spotlight and the bass''s neck work together to frame the musician very dramatically.  I also like the spare, stripped-to-the-bones feel of it.  Suits character of the instrument.  7', '2005-08-20 21:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627070, 218328, 30364, '<td valign="top">A really super bass player study.  The machine heads, the terrific hair and the awful tattoos, the facial expression and posture, and even the blue stage light; it all works to create a lot of interest and impact.  Excellent composition, well captured &amp; processed.  8</td>', 'A really super bass player study.  The machine heads, the terrific hair and the awful tattoos, the facial expression and posture, and even the blue stage light; it all works to create a lot of interest and impact.  Excellent composition, well captured & processed.  8', '2005-08-20 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
