(1627414, 218641, 36597, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... but sorry, I not feeling the ''Live Music''.</td>', 'Nice shot... but sorry, I not feeling the ''Live Music''.', '2005-08-21 01:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627429, 217432, 13688, '<td valign="top">great processing. kind of funny how you  caught the drummer beating herself</td>', 'great processing. kind of funny how you  caught the drummer beating herself', '2005-08-21 01:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627436, 218842, 36597, '<td valign="top">There is alot going on in this picture. I feel drawn all over the place. If you cropped out the window frame and the advertisement on the building... you would end up with a colourful shot and the musician would take front stage. Good Luck.</td>', 'There is alot going on in this picture. I feel drawn all over the place. If you cropped out the window frame and the advertisement on the building... you would end up with a colourful shot and the musician would take front stage. Good Luck.', '2005-08-21 01:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627437, 218882, 36597, '<td valign="top">It''s a good image... However, I would like to see more... to really sell it.<br/>Good Luck.</td>', 'It''s a good image... However, I would like to see more... to really sell it.Good Luck.', '2005-08-21 01:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627446, 218785, 13688, '<td valign="top">i dig the trippy multi-image.  i''m not so into the surroundings.  i feel like i''m in an office building and not in a club.</td>', 'i dig the trippy multi-image.  i''m not so into the surroundings.  i feel like i''m in an office building and not in a club.', '2005-08-21 02:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627451, 218597, 30364, '<td valign="top">Strong image.  The tight crop and your chosen depth of field together strip away all potential distractions, and ensures the subject dominates the shot .  Also well photographed and processed.  7</td>', 'Strong image.  The tight crop and your chosen depth of field together strip away all potential distractions, and ensures the subject dominates the shot .  Also well photographed and processed.  7', '2005-08-21 02:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627460, 217856, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific photograph.  The relationship between the guitarist and the most prominent fan is wonderful; shows just how much the former loves making music &amp; how much the latter enjoys it.  I''d have still been happy if you''d decided to crop off the bit of a person (?) encroaching on the right, even though it would mean knocking a bit off the fan''s shoulder.  8</td>', 'Terrific photograph.  The relationship between the guitarist and the most prominent fan is wonderful; shows just how much the former loves making music & how much the latter enjoys it.  I''d have still been happy if you''d decided to crop off the bit of a person (?) encroaching on the right, even though it would mean knocking a bit off the fan''s shoulder.  8', '2005-08-21 02:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627464, 218814, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Something about the body language of the two spectators suggests to me that they are more annoyed than appreciative of the performance.  And something about the musician''s body language suggests he doesn''t give a stuff what they think; they''re gonna get the damn song anyway.  It''s a very appealing and interesting photograph.  It tells a story and stimulates the viewer''s imagination, and that''s what I think good, artistic photography is about!  9</td>', 'I like this.  Something about the body language of the two spectators suggests to me that they are more annoyed than appreciative of the performance.  And something about the musician''s body language suggests he doesn''t give a stuff what they think; they''re gonna get the damn song anyway.  It''s a very appealing and interesting photograph.  It tells a story and stimulates the viewer''s imagination, and that''s what I think good, artistic photography is about!  9', '2005-08-21 02:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627468, 218852, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, well cropped.  The effect of the two light forearms and the light hat framing the dark face is striking.  7</td>', 'Nice composition, well cropped.  The effect of the two light forearms and the light hat framing the dark face is striking.  7', '2005-08-21 02:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627470, 217525, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like the fact that he''s not quite a silhouette.  Makes it more interesting.  7</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like the fact that he''s not quite a silhouette.  Makes it more interesting.  7', '2005-08-21 02:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627473, 217378, 30364, '<td valign="top">A simple but very thoughtful composition that doesn''t overlook an important element of a live music image; audience appreciation.  Well conceived and executed.  8</td>', 'A simple but very thoughtful composition that doesn''t overlook an important element of a live music image; audience appreciation.  Well conceived and executed.  8', '2005-08-21 02:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627479, 217425, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Not perfect; the obscured face of the second musician and the unfortunately placed dangling stringy thing that hangs off the first guy''s bow each detract a bit from the image.  But it is a convincing candid live music photograph.  7</td>', 'I like it.  Not perfect; the obscured face of the second musician and the unfortunately placed dangling stringy thing that hangs off the first guy''s bow each detract a bit from the image.  But it is a convincing candid live music photograph.  7', '2005-08-21 02:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627494, 219020, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail. This is really good!!!! It has that urban edge. She looks like a true love child.  Upon 2nd review, this one still is one of my favorites.  It is totally natural with no filtration - just a natural picture of a girl and her recorder.  .  10</td>', 'Wonderful detail. This is really good!!!! It has that urban edge. She looks like a true love child.  Upon 2nd review, this one still is one of my favorites.  It is totally natural with no filtration - just a natural picture of a girl and her recorder.  .  10', '2005-08-21 02:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627523, 217033, 36619, '<td valign="top">i like the askwed-ness off the photo and the blur of the crowd. however even though a stage-like thing is present, it''s unclear to me just what the source of music.</td>', 'i like the askwed-ness off the photo and the blur of the crowd. however even though a stage-like thing is present, it''s unclear to me just what the source of music.', '2005-08-21 03:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627546, 218612, 20056, '<td valign="top">Having fun with the music and photography! :)</td>', 'Having fun with the music and photography! :)', '2005-08-21 04:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627549, 218517, 20056, '<td valign="top">The piano support the picture... I like it  much!</td>', 'The piano support the picture... I like it  much!', '2005-08-21 04:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627553, 218451, 20056, '<td valign="top">greate idea! , Maybe too much shutter speed... or too little :)</td>', 'greate idea! , Maybe too much shutter speed... or too little :)', '2005-08-21 04:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
