(1627611, 216940, 1796, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective, composition, the groovy feel of the picture. Technically excellent, too, great use of B&amp;W.</td>', 'Love the perspective, composition, the groovy feel of the picture. Technically excellent, too, great use of B&W.', '2005-08-21 05:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627612, 219040, 1796, '<td valign="top">Sorry, can''t stand that selective D-sat look anymore. And, I''m sorry to say, I don''t feel like you make terribly original use of the technique. And just using a technique won''t give you high scores on here. I know from my own experience. Try to focus on getting a well composed, nicely lit, sharp picture that makes good use of perspective and DOF and that is at least a little ORIGINAL. This isn''t.<br/> <br/>No offense, please, I''m just trying to help.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/>Bruce<br/> <br/>PS: gave you a 4 for uninspired but technically sound</td>', 'Sorry, can''t stand that selective D-sat look anymore. And, I''m sorry to say, I don''t feel like you make terribly original use of the technique. And just using a technique won''t give you high scores on here. I know from my own experience. Try to focus on getting a well composed, nicely lit, sharp picture that makes good use of perspective and DOF and that is at least a little ORIGINAL. This isn''t. No offense, please, I''m just trying to help. Cheers,Bruce PS: gave you a 4 for uninspired but technically sound', '2005-08-21 05:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627616, 218151, 1796, '<td valign="top">Sorry, can''t stand that selective D-sat look anymore. And, I''m sorry to say, I don''t feel like you make terribly original use of the technique. And just using a technique won''t give you high scores on here. I know from my own experience. <br/> <br/>Try to focus on getting a well composed, nicely lit, sharp picture that makes good use of perspective and DOF and that is a little more ORIGINAL. <br/> <br/>No offense, please, I''m just trying to help.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/>Bruce<br/> <br/>PS: gave you a 6 for on topic, technically sound but not very exciting</td>', 'Sorry, can''t stand that selective D-sat look anymore. And, I''m sorry to say, I don''t feel like you make terribly original use of the technique. And just using a technique won''t give you high scores on here. I know from my own experience.  Try to focus on getting a well composed, nicely lit, sharp picture that makes good use of perspective and DOF and that is a little more ORIGINAL.  No offense, please, I''m just trying to help. Cheers,Bruce PS: gave you a 6 for on topic, technically sound but not very exciting', '2005-08-21 05:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627619, 218361, 1796, '<td valign="top">nice, off center composition, like the diagonal the guitar''s neck creates, the guys right arm with all the muscles and veins showing. Wonder how this would look in color.<br/> <br/>Very nice!</td>', 'nice, off center composition, like the diagonal the guitar''s neck creates, the guys right arm with all the muscles and veins showing. Wonder how this would look in color. Very nice!', '2005-08-21 05:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627620, 218597, 1796, '<td valign="top">Wow. truly stunning! Love the combination of relative clarity and extreme softness of the background. <br/> <br/>Reminds me a little of my own pic:<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=120488<br/> <br/>My first 10 during the current voting, you deserve it!</td>', 'Wow. truly stunning! Love the combination of relative clarity and extreme softness of the background.  Reminds me a little of my own pic://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=120488 My first 10 during the current voting, you deserve it!', '2005-08-21 05:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627621, 218909, 1796, '<td valign="top">very alive, but very snapshotty, too. Is that a very cheap camera or a terribly inappropriate ISO setting causing all the noise I see here?<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'very alive, but very snapshotty, too. Is that a very cheap camera or a terribly inappropriate ISO setting causing all the noise I see here? 6', '2005-08-21 05:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627623, 216769, 1796, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the yellow/greenish background. otherwise well done, good composition, funny twist with the pressed down strings that break up the otherwise parallel lines that dominate the diagonals.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'I don''t care for the yellow/greenish background. otherwise well done, good composition, funny twist with the pressed down strings that break up the otherwise parallel lines that dominate the diagonals. 7', '2005-08-21 05:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627624, 216663, 1796, '<td valign="top">a little too dark for my taste (going for the gothic, dark thing here, were you?) but a very cool perspective and good use of the motion blur on the bassist''s right hand. the red glove/mit adds to the attention that detail gets from me. Well done.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'a little too dark for my taste (going for the gothic, dark thing here, were you?) but a very cool perspective and good use of the motion blur on the bassist''s right hand. the red glove/mit adds to the attention that detail gets from me. Well done. 8', '2005-08-21 05:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627625, 217033, 1796, '<td valign="top">NICE!<br/> <br/>Love the letterbox format, the motion blur, the great light, contrast between the blue of the sky and the greenish yellow of the lights and people''s clothing.<br/> <br/>Great use of the "wrong" white balance setting!<br/> <br/>gets a 9 from me, actually, I''ll even give you a ten.</td>', 'NICE! Love the letterbox format, the motion blur, the great light, contrast between the blue of the sky and the greenish yellow of the lights and people''s clothing. Great use of the "wrong" white balance setting! gets a 9 from me, actually, I''ll even give you a ten.', '2005-08-21 05:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627633, 217392, 3306, '<td valign="top">It took me a second to figure out what he was doing. Very unique capture of live music. Good job on placement of the subject in the frame. The backround is complimentary and adds interest to the picture.</td>', 'It took me a second to figure out what he was doing. Very unique capture of live music. Good job on placement of the subject in the frame. The backround is complimentary and adds interest to the picture.', '2005-08-21 06:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627659, 217256, 42261, '<td valign="top">Can´t see how this is live music but maby that´s just me :)</td>', 'Can´t see how this is live music but maby that´s just me :)', '2005-08-21 08:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627664, 218138, 42261, '<td valign="top">that is a big question!! :) genial idea</td>', 'that is a big question!! :) genial idea', '2005-08-21 08:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627702, 218845, 7304, '<td valign="top">This is the best shot in my book. Very nicely done. 9</td>', 'This is the best shot in my book. Very nicely done. 9', '2005-08-21 09:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627703, 218970, 7304, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Nice clarity and I love the contrast. Never give up that passion no matter how old you feel.</td>', 'Great capture. Nice clarity and I love the contrast. Never give up that passion no matter how old you feel.', '2005-08-21 09:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627704, 217606, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear. You can see the cheeks tesion as he blows that sax. 7</td>', 'Nice and clear. You can see the cheeks tesion as he blows that sax. 7', '2005-08-21 09:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627705, 218597, 7304, '<td valign="top">You can tell he''s into the music. Nice shot. Nice and clean.</td>', 'You can tell he''s into the music. Nice shot. Nice and clean.', '2005-08-21 09:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627706, 218324, 7304, '<td valign="top">You captured some feeling in this shot. I see the tension in the vein in his forehead. Nice capture.</td>', 'You captured some feeling in this shot. I see the tension in the vein in his forehead. Nice capture.', '2005-08-21 09:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627707, 218666, 7304, '<td valign="top">How did you get this close? Excellent capture of his wailing voice. Like the red light in the back as it helps pop him off the page a bit.</td>', 'How did you get this close? Excellent capture of his wailing voice. Like the red light in the back as it helps pop him off the page a bit.', '2005-08-21 09:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627708, 217142, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice and clean. He is cool. Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice and clean. He is cool. Nice composition.', '2005-08-21 09:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1627709, 218411, 7304, '<td valign="top">Well, a crotch shot isn''t my idea of nice to view on him but it is a dramatic angle and adds to his style. Like the expression you captured and I''d say you were lucky to be this close.</td>', 'Well, a crotch shot isn''t my idea of nice to view on him but it is a dramatic angle and adds to his style. Like the expression you captured and I''d say you were lucky to be this close.', '2005-08-21 09:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
