(1634875, 218025, 39243, '<td valign="top">my last photo got slammed because of a lack of focus in a dark environment - I imaging you had the same trouble I did. Good take on the live music theme but the focus is just too blurry for me.</td>', 'my last photo got slammed because of a lack of focus in a dark environment - I imaging you had the same trouble I did. Good take on the live music theme but the focus is just too blurry for me.', '2005-08-23 06:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
