(1634999, 218638, 40976, '<td valign="top">Too much yellow saturation and it looks like the uniform got washed out.  Maybe lower your brightness levels a little to get some of the detail back in the lighter parts of this shot.</td>', 'Too much yellow saturation and it looks like the uniform got washed out.  Maybe lower your brightness levels a little to get some of the detail back in the lighter parts of this shot.', '2005-08-23 08:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
