(1635253, 219110, 42866, '<td valign="top">The expression on the singer''s face is very fitting for the live music theme.  The mic stuff is distracting, but some is necessary so we know what she''s doing.  You might play around with making the photo narrower, or possibly cropping to just the face and a little bit of the mic.  Having said that, the outfit does to the simplicity/mellowness of the singer''s passion.</td>', 'The expression on the singer''s face is very fitting for the live music theme.  The mic stuff is distracting, but some is necessary so we know what she''s doing.  You might play around with making the photo narrower, or possibly cropping to just the face and a little bit of the mic.  Having said that, the outfit does to the simplicity/mellowness of the singer''s passion.', '2005-08-23 10:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
