(1635783, 217240, 10867, '<td valign="top">The child with the red crutches is the attention grabber in this scene.  The live music definitely plays second fiddle (yes, ouch, I know) in the image as a whole.</td>', 'The child with the red crutches is the attention grabber in this scene.  The live music definitely plays second fiddle (yes, ouch, I know) in the image as a whole.', '2005-08-23 13:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
