(1637694, 218970, 34906, '<td valign="top">I want to thank you for the wonderful reception to this photo and the 6th place. As a relative newcomer, I feel humbled. The feeling that it conveys must have compensated for the flaws in technique.  <br/> <br/>I never could get this image close to the vision I had for it initially, and the comments criticizing aspects of it were the very things I myself struggled with and didn''t solve.  I am thrilled that something about this image has spoken to so many of you.  <br/> <br/>The model is a very important figure in my life - my father.  I would really like you to visit the link below, where I unveil his face and do a short pictoral history of his life as a musician.  I created this page specifically because so many of you were impressed with his hands and wanted to learn more about the man.  I hope you enjoy. <br/> <br/>Any feedback would be appreciated.  I''ve been letting him read all of the comments you have made, and he has loved them.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.hootsandtoots.com/Dad" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">My Model</a></td>', 'I want to thank you for the wonderful reception to this photo and the 6th place. As a relative newcomer, I feel humbled. The feeling that it conveys must have compensated for the flaws in technique.   I never could get this image close to the vision I had for it initially, and the comments criticizing aspects of it were the very things I myself struggled with and didn''t solve.  I am thrilled that something about this image has spoken to so many of you.   The model is a very important figure in my life - my father.  I would really like you to visit the link below, where I unveil his face and do a short pictoral history of his life as a musician.  I created this page specifically because so many of you were impressed with his hands and wanted to learn more about the man.  I hope you enjoy.  Any feedback would be appreciated.  I''ve been letting him read all of the comments you have made, and he has loved them. My Model', '2005-08-24 01:05:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1637698, 218324, 15711, '<td valign="top">This picture suits your name perfectly.  And you are that as is he!!!  Great finish.  I think should have won a ribbon myself.</td>', 'This picture suits your name perfectly.  And you are that as is he!!!  Great finish.  I think should have won a ribbon myself.', '2005-08-24 01:05:51.000000', NULL, 0),
