(1638010, 218552, 42279, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the many great comments.  This was my first submission and actually this challenge was the reason why I joined (I was planning to join though).  Anyway, he just turned two and was not really playing, but banging on keys.  However, he was "playing" with the piano after dinner a few nights in a row pretending just like a great piano soloist (going up and down the keys, back and forth) and I just could not resist taking his picture.  Hopefully he will be a great pianist someday.</td>', 'Thank you for the many great comments.  This was my first submission and actually this challenge was the reason why I joined (I was planning to join though).  Anyway, he just turned two and was not really playing, but banging on keys.  However, he was "playing" with the piano after dinner a few nights in a row pretending just like a great piano soloist (going up and down the keys, back and forth) and I just could not resist taking his picture.  Hopefully he will be a great pianist someday.', '2005-08-24 01:48:45.000000', NULL, 0),
