(1638789, 218610, 23394, '<td valign="top">heyah, adi!<br/> <br/>boy, i would hate to put myself in a position of feeling sorry for 250-300 people...<br/> <br/>this is the toughest part of the ''challenge''--interpreting it in a way that connects with people, while being true to yourself.  sometimes, it just isn''t going to happen.  you are happy with this image, and that''s fine.  you probably know the things you could have done WITH THIS IMAGE/SUBJECT to have scored higher (title, less sharpening, both animals in focus, etc), but it was your decision to render it this way.  don''t waste time feeling sorry for those that you didn''t connect with well enough to get your point across.  just go out and shoot something else.<br/> <br/>;-)</td>', 'heyah, adi! boy, i would hate to put myself in a position of feeling sorry for 250-300 people... this is the toughest part of the ''challenge''--interpreting it in a way that connects with people, while being true to yourself.  sometimes, it just isn''t going to happen.  you are happy with this image, and that''s fine.  you probably know the things you could have done WITH THIS IMAGE/SUBJECT to have scored higher (title, less sharpening, both animals in focus, etc), but it was your decision to render it this way.  don''t waste time feeling sorry for those that you didn''t connect with well enough to get your point across.  just go out and shoot something else. ;-)', '2005-08-24 06:28:41.000000', NULL, 0),
