(1639415, 217522, 40569, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jinjit:</b></div><hr/><i> Ok, let me tell you something:<br/>Under any other normal conditions, I would probably vote a 6 on this image, and go on voting.<br/>It''s a really nice photo, just not the "wow" kind.<br/>The hot area on the right is too distracting, something in the background gives a busy feeling to this, and I can not concentrate on the water properly. <br/>Above average photo, but not much more then that.<br/>However, under this specific challenge, I think you have chosen a beautiful shot.<br/>It is out of the box, it is creative and thoughtful.<br/>Personally, I appreciate those qualities in a photo a lot more then perfect technicalities.<br/>and I hear the music.<br/> <br/>For that - I vote a 10 on this one.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge. I have a strange feeling that we are going to end this challenge side by side ;-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for your in depth comments. This was my first challenge so I wasn''t too sure what to expect. You were right though, I believe we finished next to each other way down the list.<br/>Cheers<br/>Shane.</td>', 'Originally posted by Jinjit: Ok, let me tell you something:Under any other normal conditions, I would probably vote a 6 on this image, and go on voting.It''s a really nice photo, just not the "wow" kind.The hot area on the right is too distracting, something in the background gives a busy feeling to this, and I can not concentrate on the water properly. Above average photo, but not much more then that.However, under this specific challenge, I think you have chosen a beautiful shot.It is out of the box, it is creative and thoughtful.Personally, I appreciate those qualities in a photo a lot more then perfect technicalities.and I hear the music. For that - I vote a 10 on this one. Good luck in the challenge. I have a strange feeling that we are going to end this challenge side by side ;-)   Thanks for your in depth comments. This was my first challenge so I wasn''t too sure what to expect. You were right though, I believe we finished next to each other way down the list.CheersShane.', '2005-08-24 10:06:42.000000', NULL, 0),
