(1649246, 218610, 19708, '<td valign="top">If I hadn''t been a slug and finished voting, there would have been another 10 in your stats. My comment stands, as does my vote in thought anyway.<br/>Thanks for making the day a little brighter with a funny, unique perspective on the challenge. Cool shot Adi.<br/></td>', 'If I hadn''t been a slug and finished voting, there would have been another 10 in your stats. My comment stands, as does my vote in thought anyway.Thanks for making the day a little brighter with a funny, unique perspective on the challenge. Cool shot Adi.', '2005-08-27 05:11:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1649265, 218557, 42234, '<td valign="top">I was so upset when I saw this category because of the fact that I couldn''t enter one of my best shots ever(I ttok it in January of this year), which is a shot similar to this one only it has the trumpet player in the shot and focuses more on the music maker and not the music.  Your winning second place validates my work.  I can''t afford to be a full member of this site just yet, but seeing so many people''s art is so inspiring.  Seeing that I''ve executed some of these shots let''s me know I''m headed in the right direction artistically.  Keep up the good work.  It''s a fantastic shot!</td>', 'I was so upset when I saw this category because of the fact that I couldn''t enter one of my best shots ever(I ttok it in January of this year), which is a shot similar to this one only it has the trumpet player in the shot and focuses more on the music maker and not the music.  Your winning second place validates my work.  I can''t afford to be a full member of this site just yet, but seeing so many people''s art is so inspiring.  Seeing that I''ve executed some of these shots let''s me know I''m headed in the right direction artistically.  Keep up the good work.  It''s a fantastic shot!', '2005-08-27 06:01:13.000000', NULL, 0),
