(1656109, 216608, 24642, '<td valign="top">A beautiful colour study and a wonderful title. It''s a shame that a lot of commenters didn''t get the title.  I really love the position of the index finger, it somehow shows anticipation and excitement.</td>', 'A beautiful colour study and a wonderful title. It''s a shame that a lot of commenters didn''t get the title.  I really love the position of the index finger, it somehow shows anticipation and excitement.', '2005-08-29 20:45:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1656729, 218864, 37673, '<td valign="top">This is at best a decent snapshot I am sorry to say. The hairy heads are very distracting and in need of shampoo and conditioning. Ok seriously now... A better crop without the fore ground would benefit. I don''t know if you planned it but, I like how the guitar cought the lighting focusing your attention on it. The focus is ok it may be my monitor but could be a little sharper. The over all lightening is a bit dark could have been a little lighter but, I know you had no control there.. Composition is fine (except the heads). Everything else leads to just an average snap shot. Would have loved to heard the tune he was ripping.</td>', 'This is at best a decent snapshot I am sorry to say. The hairy heads are very distracting and in need of shampoo and conditioning. Ok seriously now... A better crop without the fore ground would benefit. I don''t know if you planned it but, I like how the guitar cought the lighting focusing your attention on it. The focus is ok it may be my monitor but could be a little sharper. The over all lightening is a bit dark could have been a little lighter but, I know you had no control there.. Composition is fine (except the heads). Everything else leads to just an average snap shot. Would have loved to heard the tune he was ripping.', '2005-08-30 00:52:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1656758, 218151, 37673, '<td valign="top">Wow I am very impressed. The composition is wonderful. Very well balanced and I especially like the way it flows from one side of the picture to the other. I tried to find a distraction and the closest thing would be the headless guy on the left. The colors are absolutely amazing. VERY nice and smooth. You did especially well here. Lighting was nicely done here also. The focus and DOF are perfect. It flows through the entire picture. I am very impressed with this shot.  Now I must tell you after writing the critique I find out you are 14. I now hand you the WOW factor. I can''t seem to find the right words to tell you how doubley impressed I am. You are on your way to a very impressive career in photography. I wish you the best of luck in your future and I thank you for the opportunity to see such an impressive shot.</td>', 'Wow I am very impressed. The composition is wonderful. Very well balanced and I especially like the way it flows from one side of the picture to the other. I tried to find a distraction and the closest thing would be the headless guy on the left. The colors are absolutely amazing. VERY nice and smooth. You did especially well here. Lighting was nicely done here also. The focus and DOF are perfect. It flows through the entire picture. I am very impressed with this shot.  Now I must tell you after writing the critique I find out you are 14. I now hand you the WOW factor. I can''t seem to find the right words to tell you how doubley impressed I am. You are on your way to a very impressive career in photography. I wish you the best of luck in your future and I thank you for the opportunity to see such an impressive shot.', '2005-08-30 01:03:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1656786, 216541, 37673, '<td valign="top">This shot falls short of the challenge but don''t let that bother you. Overall it''s a very nice and creative shot. The only problem I find with this shot is the hand is a bit over exposed. The colors are very nice and striking. Focus is lacking just a bit and could have been a bit sharper. Composition is is great. Very creative here. Well done and keep up the good work.</td>', 'This shot falls short of the challenge but don''t let that bother you. Overall it''s a very nice and creative shot. The only problem I find with this shot is the hand is a bit over exposed. The colors are very nice and striking. Focus is lacking just a bit and could have been a bit sharper. Composition is is great. Very creative here. Well done and keep up the good work.', '2005-08-30 01:08:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1656815, 217256, 40703, '<td valign="top">Ew. Good photo. Bad message. School doesn''t build a future. It cripples the intellect and demoralizes the human spirit. It forcibly squeezes an individual of one size to fit in a preposterous space of smaller proportion. It gives no time to fashion a self. And once it frees the poor soul, it leaves them dumb-founded and clueless as to what to do next. Compulsory schooling is a factory, a conveyor belt-process of instilling a mass-produced form of miseducation and brute discipline. I reason this because I have just left school, happily so, and couldn''t feel more passionate about personal enterprise. To hear that you are somewhat upset that this boy is not in school makes me feel obliged to inform you that people go on living their lives, with all their heart and soul, without ever stepping once into such a prison as school.</td>', 'Ew. Good photo. Bad message. School doesn''t build a future. It cripples the intellect and demoralizes the human spirit. It forcibly squeezes an individual of one size to fit in a preposterous space of smaller proportion. It gives no time to fashion a self. And once it frees the poor soul, it leaves them dumb-founded and clueless as to what to do next. Compulsory schooling is a factory, a conveyor belt-process of instilling a mass-produced form of miseducation and brute discipline. I reason this because I have just left school, happily so, and couldn''t feel more passionate about personal enterprise. To hear that you are somewhat upset that this boy is not in school makes me feel obliged to inform you that people go on living their lives, with all their heart and soul, without ever stepping once into such a prison as school.', '2005-08-30 01:16:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1656831, 217480, 37673, '<td valign="top">A few things wrong here. It looks like just a plain snap shot. Lighting is direct nothing creative here. Focus is good. Composition is plain and again no creativity. Too many distractions here. The mike, his hand needed to be cropped a bit lower and eyes are closed. Nice shot forf memory just nothing explosive here for a challenge</td>', 'A few things wrong here. It looks like just a plain snap shot. Lighting is direct nothing creative here. Focus is good. Composition is plain and again no creativity. Too many distractions here. The mike, his hand needed to be cropped a bit lower and eyes are closed. Nice shot forf memory just nothing explosive here for a challenge', '2005-08-30 01:18:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1656853, 218557, 37673, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club. It took me a while to find anything wrong here and it is so minor. The only thing I could find wrong if you could evewn call it that was the cropping of the horn. It looks just a bit too tight. Everything else is simply put AMAZING. The creativity is fantastic. Focus is perfect and the DOF couldn''t have been better. Lighting was exact. The B&amp;W was inspiring. Very nicely done. Keep up the great work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-05 00:44:50.</i></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club. It took me a while to find anything wrong here and it is so minor. The only thing I could find wrong if you could evewn call it that was the cropping of the horn. It looks just a bit too tight. Everything else is simply put AMAZING. The creativity is fantastic. Focus is perfect and the DOF couldn''t have been better. Lighting was exact. The B&W was inspiring. Very nicely done. Keep up the great work.', '2005-08-30 01:31:29.000000', '2005-10-05 01:44:50.000000', 0),
