(1658354, 216426, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great title &amp; shot.  I meant to comment on this during the challenge, but ran out of time.  (BTW: I scored it a 7)  Great emotive performance shot.  Love the colors and dark overtones.  Looks like it''s in a high school gym or something.  Very young, grungy, hip feel.  Nice job.</td>', 'Great title & shot.  I meant to comment on this during the challenge, but ran out of time.  (BTW: I scored it a 7)  Great emotive performance shot.  Love the colors and dark overtones.  Looks like it''s in a high school gym or something.  Very young, grungy, hip feel.  Nice job.', '2005-08-30 16:16:11.000000', NULL, 0),
