(1691758, 219059, 13688, '<td valign="top">Well...upon further consideration...wtf did i submit this?  Anyway I did like the composition and the subject though the processing was over the top.  I was working on my USM mega radius style (i find halos around my subjects very renaissance,  maybe it will be hip in photography in a few hundred years).</td>', 'Well...upon further consideration...wtf did i submit this?  Anyway I did like the composition and the subject though the processing was over the top.  I was working on my USM mega radius style (i find halos around my subjects very renaissance,  maybe it will be hip in photography in a few hundred years).', '2005-09-10 00:21:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1701939, 217681, 23680, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10 during the voting and just visited it again - One of my favorites of the challenge and feel it should have scored higher.  Nice emotion you captured here without even seeing a face.  Good choice of desaturation, but not overdone!</td>', 'I gave this a 10 during the voting and just visited it again - One of my favorites of the challenge and feel it should have scored higher.  Nice emotion you captured here without even seeing a face.  Good choice of desaturation, but not overdone!', '2005-09-12 23:53:44.000000', NULL, 0),
