(1820239, 218324, 24486, '<td valign="top">Carey Bell is such an awesome harp player &amp; you really did him justice by this incredible composition. Had I not have been away from home during the month of this challenge, you would of got 32 10''s. This really is a top effort. Congratulations on 4th place.</td>', 'Carey Bell is such an awesome harp player & you really did him justice by this incredible composition. Had I not have been away from home during the month of this challenge, you would of got 32 10''s. This really is a top effort. Congratulations on 4th place.', '2005-10-28 04:40:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1839505, 219044, 42100, '<td valign="top">The strong part of this photo is that it is telling us a story.  The negative is that I think you have competing focal points in the composition.  De-emphasizing the hand in some way might help, or maybe rather the showerhead since the photo is about the singer.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-04 23:42:21.</i></td>', 'The strong part of this photo is that it is telling us a story.  The negative is that I think you have competing focal points in the composition.  De-emphasizing the hand in some way might help, or maybe rather the showerhead since the photo is about the singer.', '2005-11-04 23:41:24.000000', '2005-11-04 23:42:21.000000', 0),
