(2239717, 217856, 31606, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to add to my comment below and the only way you would know it was there is if I posted a new one.  I meant to also include that I remember in my 20''s going to see then many unknowns at a club in Atlanta call "The Masquerade" it has since been closed down and they are building I think high rise apartments.  Anyways is was an old cotton mill turned into a 3 story club.  Bottom floor was Hell, middle was Purgatory, and top was Heaven.  All the concerts were held in Heaven and I remember seeing Prong, Danzig, Type O Negative, Pantera, Stuck Mojo and bands like that.  This photo brought back those good memories.  I was always the guy on the right screaming "HELL YEAH".........Oh the good old days.  Thanks for bringing that back. <br/> <br/>One side note for the ones that will remember I went and saw Ugly Kid Joe perform at The Masquerade just before their first big hit "I Hate Everything About You" that was the first of many shows at that place.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-02 16:16:10.</i></td>', 'I just wanted to add to my comment below and the only way you would know it was there is if I posted a new one.  I meant to also include that I remember in my 20''s going to see then many unknowns at a club in Atlanta call "The Masquerade" it has since been closed down and they are building I think high rise apartments.  Anyways is was an old cotton mill turned into a 3 story club.  Bottom floor was Hell, middle was Purgatory, and top was Heaven.  All the concerts were held in Heaven and I remember seeing Prong, Danzig, Type O Negative, Pantera, Stuck Mojo and bands like that.  This photo brought back those good memories.  I was always the guy on the right screaming "HELL YEAH".........Oh the good old days.  Thanks for bringing that back.  One side note for the ones that will remember I went and saw Ugly Kid Joe perform at The Masquerade just before their first big hit "I Hate Everything About You" that was the first of many shows at that place.', '2006-03-19 18:46:52.000000', '2006-04-02 17:16:10.000000', 0),
