(2670661, 218248, 37430, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is simply wonderful and rates very high of being different. This  kind of creativity is rare as DPC ruins you with steriotype thinking :) I really like the choice of subject, the message being communicated and the cropping of the photo. The only thing which I might like here is bit more of highlightes. I''d still like it to be lowkey, but a bit more of contrast will enhance the curves and contours on wonderful body. Lovely photo.</td>', 'Wow! This is simply wonderful and rates very high of being different. This  kind of creativity is rare as DPC ruins you with steriotype thinking :) I really like the choice of subject, the message being communicated and the cropping of the photo. The only thing which I might like here is bit more of highlightes. I''d still like it to be lowkey, but a bit more of contrast will enhance the curves and contours on wonderful body. Lovely photo.', '2006-07-28 05:29:17.000000', NULL, 0),
